{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AbzjAMpZMvWTMx68x4wSvn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心张力未化解。Reviewers形成pincer attack：(a) ρ=0.997说明DIF不影响rankings→''so\n2\t  what''； (b) 31%可能是MH method artifact（unidimensional IRT misfit + LLM population违反MH\n3\t  assumptions）。 需要fundamental reframing：从''DIF reveals instability''转向''DIF as stress\n4\t  test for benchmark measurement assumptions''。98% Lz misfit翻转为primary finding；C%变异reframe为benchmark-specific\n5\t  measurement properties；ρ=0.997 reframe为massive redundancy finding；semi-synthetic降级为\n6\t  methodological appendix。新headline：psychometric audit reveals systematic violations\n7\t  of measurement invariance assumptions。补充实验：multidimensional IRT pilot（至少2-factor\n8\t  model）。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n13\t  plan_id: plan_001\n14\t  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix上的MH-DIF分析，temporal cohort\n15\t    (2023 vs 2024-H1)，含within-family confound control和domain-specificity分析\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n18\t    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n19\t    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n20\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n21\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n22\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n23\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n24\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n25\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n26\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n27\t    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n28\t    lz_misfit_pct_above_2: 98.0\n29\t    reviewer_avg_score_impact: -0.5\n30\t  result_rationale: '31.3% C%本身是solid empirical finding，random split control (0.18%)确认非统计噪声。\n31\t    但在worst档，reviewers攻击三个方向：(1) enrichment=0.96意味着DIF flags与web-overlap labels 几乎正交——reviewer解读为\"DIF没检测到任何已知contamination\"而非\"labels不匹配\"；\n32\t    (2) 98% |Lz|>2表明unidimensional IRT对MMLU fundamentally misspecified，MH-DIF依赖 IRT\n33\t    conditioning变量的validity，而conditioning变量本身就有问题——reviewer引用此数据 作为method validity的反面证据；(3)\n34\t    within-family Llama-2v3 C%=61.3%远高于temporal 31.3%， reviewer认为这暴露了ability confound——能力差距越大DIF越高，temporal\n35\t    DIF可能只是residual ability confound。domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02)进一步给reviewer ammunition——存在系统性的\n36\t    \"模型变好→DIF升高\"的生态学相关，尽管item-level decomposition只解释7.6%，但reviewer 不信任decomposition方法本身。\n37\t\n38\t    '\n39\t  tables:\n40\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary'\n41\t    columns:\n42\t    - cohort_definition\n43\t    - N_ref\n44\t    - N_foc\n45\t    - C_pct\n46\t    - random_control_pct\n47\t    - enrichment_vs_li\n48\t    rows:\n49\t    - - temporal_2023v2024\n50\t      - 1253\n51\t      - 656\n52\t      - 31.3\n53\t      - 0.18\n54\t      - 0.96\n55\t    - - ability_quintile\n56\t      - 2610\n57\t      - 2610\n58\t      - 2.9\n59\t      - 0.18\n60\t      - 1.19\n61\t    - - within_family_llama\n62\t      - 161\n63\t      - 308\n64\t      - 61.3\n65\t      - —\n66\t      - —\n67\t    - - within_family_mistral\n68\t      - 106\n69\t      - 84\n70\t      - 38.7\n71\t      - —\n72\t      - —\n73\t  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-specificity (top/bottom 5 subjects)'\n74\t    columns:\n75\t    - subject\n76\t    - C_pct\n77\t    - n_items\n78\t    - domain_acc_delta\n79\t    rows:\n80\t    - - business_ethics\n81\t      - 48.4\n82\t      - 100\n83\t      - 0.12\n84\t    - - human_aging\n85\t      - 41.9\n86\t      - 223\n87\t      - 0.09\n88\t    - - formal_logic\n89\t      - 40.4\n90\t      - 126\n91\t      - 0.07\n92\t    - - computer_security\n93\t      - 20.7\n94\t      - 100\n95\t      - 0.11\n96\t    - - marketing\n97\t      - 20.9\n98\t      - 234\n99\t      - 0.06\n100\t  figures_description:\n101\t  - 'Figure 1: MMLU C% histogram (12,508 items) showing bimodal |Δ_MH| distribution\n102\t    with 31.3% exceeding ETS C threshold. Reviewer注意到distribution右尾的heavy tail——可能暗示小部分items有extreme\n103\t    DIF而非widespread instability'\n104\t  - 'Figure 2: Domain-specificity scatter (57 subjects): C% vs domain accuracy improvement\n105\t    (ρ=0.307). Reviewer圈出右上象限——高improvement+高DIF subjects作为ability confound evidence'\n106\t  analysis: 'Worst-case reviewer解读：(1) temporal enrichment=0.96被视为validation failure——\n107\t    \"your method doesn''t detect known contamination\"；(2) 98% Lz misfit被正面引用为 \"MH-DIF在MMLU上的assumptions全部violated\"；(3)\n108\t    within-family C%=61.3%被解读为 \"DIF is just detecting ability differences, not item\n109\t    instability\"。需要proactive reframing：Lz misfit本身就是newsworthy finding，enrichment=0.96是expected而非failure，\n110\t    within-family结果motivates MIMIC model future work。至少1位reviewer会要求propensity-score\n111\t    matching或MIMIC model替代简单NN matching。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n115\t  plan_id: plan_002\n116\t  description: RL robustness验证：SFT-only baseline + alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO N=477) +\n117\t    reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO 10-15 models) 三组比较\n118\t  expected_results:\n119\t    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n120\t    sft_only_c_pct: 30.8\n121\t    alignment_rl_c_pct: 32.1\n122\t    reasoning_rl_added_c_pct: 31.5\n123\t    jaccard_sft_vs_alignment: 0.82\n124\t    jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_added: 0.79\n125\t    delong_p_dif_vs_constat: 0.23\n126\t    constat_auroc_sft: 0.71\n127\t    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n128\t    dif_auroc_sft: 0.62\n129\t    dif_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.58\n130\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.15\n131\t    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff:\n132\t    - -0.08\n133\t    - 0.16\n134\t    power_analysis_delta_boundary: 1.2\n135\t    reviewer_verdict: underpowered and unconvincing\n136\t  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL models是致命弱点。在worst档，reviewer直接dismiss整个实验为underpowered：\n137\t    (1) 13个reasoning-RL models加入focal cohort (N=656+13=669)几乎不改变C%——从31.3%到31.5%，\n138\t    但reviewer指出这说明的不是robustness而是13个models在N=669中统计上invisible； (2) TOST equivalence\n139\t    test p=0.15 fail to reject non-equivalence——reviewer得出\"你 无法证明DIF对reasoning-RL\n140\t    robust\"；(3) traditional detectors (ConStat)在reasoning-RL 上确实降级(AUROC 0.71→0.43)，但DIF本身也降级(0.62→0.58)，DeLong\n141\t    test p=0.23 non-significant——reviewer说\"没有evidence DIF比alternatives更robust\"；(4)\n142\t    power analysis显示detection boundary在δ=1.2，比operational region (δ≥1.4)低，但reviewer\n143\t    认为这只是theoretical guarantee，实际数据上没验证。整个plan_002被reviewer一致要求 从main claims中删除或降级到future\n144\t    work。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t  tables:\n148\t  - name: 'Table: RL Robustness Comparison'\n149\t    columns:\n150\t    - cohort\n151\t    - N\n152\t    - C_pct\n153\t    - AUROC_DIF\n154\t    - AUROC_ConStat\n155\t    - AUROC_MinKpp\n156\t    rows:\n157\t    - - SFT_only\n158\t      - 412\n159\t      - 30.8\n160\t      - 0.62\n161\t      - 0.71\n162\t      - 0.65\n163\t    - - Alignment_RL\n164\t      - 477\n165\t      - 32.1\n166\t      - 0.61\n167\t      - 0.68\n168\t      - 0.63\n169\t    - - +Reasoning_RL\n170\t      - 13\n171\t      - 31.5\n172\t      - 0.58\n173\t      - 0.43\n174\t      - 0.41\n175\t  figures_description:\n176\t  - 'Figure: DIF detection power curve as function of exploitation rate p, with N=13\n177\t    reasoning-RL overlay showing wide CIs that overlap with zero improvement region'\n178\t  analysis: 'Experiment致命缺陷是sample size。METABENCH中reasoning-RL models太少(13)，无法做 meaningful\n179\t    group-level比较。Even if DIF flags不变，reviewer legitimately argues 这是statistical insensitivity而非robustness。推荐：(1)降级为limitations\n180\t    section disclosure；(2)如果能获取更多reasoning-RL model responses (N≥50)则有rebuttal价值；\n181\t    (3)reframe为\"alignment-RL robustness\"(N=477足够)而非\"reasoning-RL robustness\"。\n182\t\n183\t    '\n184\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n185\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n186\t  description: ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的语义等价reformulation，比较original\n187\t    vs reformulated performance\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    n_items_reformulated: 220\n190\t    constat_detection_rate: 0.38\n191\t    constat_fdr_controlled_rate: 0.29\n192\t    constat_auroc_vs_li_labels: 0.61\n193\t    dif_auroc_vs_li_labels: 0.52\n194\t    constat_detects_dif_misses: 47\n195\t    dif_detects_constat_misses: 31\n196\t    jaccard_dif_constat: 0.18\n197\t    constat_fpr: 0.12\n198\t    constat_correlation_with_dif_delta_mh: 0.15\n199\t    reviewer_interpretation: ConStat is complementary but outperforms DIF on per-model\n200\t      detection\n201\t  result_rationale: '在worst档，ConStat表现decent (AUROC=0.61 vs DIF 0.52 against Li labels)，reviewer\n202\t    用此攻击DIF的utility：\"为什么不直接用ConStat？它不需要temporal cohorts，不依赖 unidimensional IRT，且AUROC更高。\"\n203\t    关键问题：(1) ConStat是per-model detector而DIF 是group-level——conceptually不同，但reviewer不care\n204\t    about conceptual distinction， 只看performance numbers；(2) Jaccard=0.18意味着两种方法检测的items高度不重叠，\n205\t    本应是complementarity argument，但reviewer解读为\"DIF检测的instability与ConStat 检测的contamination无关——进一步说明DIF检测的不是contamination而是IRT\n206\t    misfit artifact\"； (3) ConStat FPR=0.12低于DIF的implicit ~0.31 FPR (against Li clean\n207\t    items)，reviewer 认为DIF over-flags。ConStat的成功paradoxically undermines DIF narrative。\n208\t\n209\t    '\n210\t  tables:\n211\t  - name: 'Table: ConStat vs DIF Detection Comparison'\n212\t    columns:\n213\t    - method\n214\t    - AUROC_vs_Li\n215\t    - FPR\n216\t    - detection_rate\n217\t    - items_unique\n218\t    rows:\n219\t    - - ConStat\n220\t      - 0.61\n221\t      - 0.12\n222\t      - 0.29\n223\t      - 47\n224\t    - - DIF_MH\n225\t      - 0.52\n226\t      - 0.31\n227\t      - 0.31\n228\t      - 31\n229\t    - - overlap\n230\t      - —\n231\t      - —\n232\t      - —\n233\t      - Jaccard=0.18\n234\t  figures_description:\n235\t  - 'Figure: Venn diagram of ConStat vs DIF flagged items showing low overlap (Jaccard=0.18),\n236\t    with reviewer annotation ''DIF captures something different from contamination'''\n237\t  analysis: 'ConStat结果在worst档是double-edged：complementarity客观上支持ensemble argument，\n238\t    但reviewer weapon化低overlap来argue DIF不检测contamination。需要reframing： ConStat和DIF检测不同construct\n239\t    (perturbation sensitivity vs temporal differential functioning)，低overlap是expected。但在worst档这个argument不被接受。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n243\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n244\t  description: DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15 open-weight models × 50 responses/item\n245\t    via temperature sampling\n246\t  expected_results:\n247\t    n_models_tested: 12\n248\t    n_items_scored: 500\n249\t    dvd_detection_rate: 0.22\n250\t    dvd_bimodal_items: 34\n251\t    dvd_auroc_vs_li: 0.58\n252\t    dvd_fpr: 0.08\n253\t    dvd_detects_variant_contamination: true\n254\t    dif_misses_variant_items: 28\n255\t    dvd_misses_verbatim_items: 41\n256\t    correlation_dvd_dif: 0.09\n257\t    reviewer_interpretation: DVD captures a contamination mode DIF completely misses\n258\t  result_rationale: 'DVD在worst档表现modest (AUROC=0.58)但暴露DIF的structural blind spot：variant\n259\t    contamination。(1) 34个bimodal-distribution items中28个(82%)被DIF missed——reviewer\n260\t    argues DIF只能检测verbatim memorization的differential效应，对paraphrase/variant contamination完全blind；(2)\n261\t    DVD和DIF的correlation=0.09几乎正交——reviewer interprets this as \"DIF measures something\n262\t    orthogonal to contamination\"；(3) DVD的FPR=0.08 远低于DIF的implicit FPR，进一步支持\"DIF over-flags\"叙事。DVD的per-model\n263\t    nature 也means reviewer质疑为什么需要group-level DIF when per-model methods exist。 关键攻击：如果contamination是variant而非verbatim（increasingly\n264\t    likely with reasoning-RL models），DIF fundamentally无法检测。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t  tables:\n268\t  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Results'\n269\t    columns:\n270\t    - contamination_mode\n271\t    - n_items\n272\t    - dvd_detected\n273\t    - dif_detected\n274\t    - both_detected\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - bimodal_variant\n277\t      - 34\n278\t      - 28\n279\t      - 6\n280\t      - 4\n281\t    - - high_variance\n282\t      - 78\n283\t      - 45\n284\t      - 22\n285\t      - 12\n286\t    - - normal\n287\t      - 388\n288\t      - 31\n289\t      - 125\n290\t      - 18\n291\t  figures_description:\n292\t  - 'Figure: Generation variance distributions for 3 example items — one clean, one\n293\t    verbatim-contaminated (DIF catches, DVD misses), one variant-contaminated (DVD\n294\t    catches, DIF misses)'\n295\t  analysis: 'DVD暴露DIF对variant contamination的blind spot。在worst档这被reviewer elevation\n296\t    为fundamental limitation：\"随着models increasingly使用paraphrase training data， DIF的检测能力将progressive降低。\"\n297\t    需要honest acknowledgment在limitations中。\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n301\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n302\t  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：calibrated thresholds, majority voting, weighted\n303\t    fusion\n304\t  expected_results:\n305\t    ensemble_auroc_majority: 0.64\n306\t    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.67\n307\t    ensemble_fpr: 0.09\n308\t    dif_only_auroc: 0.52\n309\t    constat_only_auroc: 0.61\n310\t    dvd_only_auroc: 0.58\n311\t    dif_incremental_auroc_over_constat_dvd: 0.02\n312\t    cross_val_weight_dif: 0.21\n313\t    cross_val_weight_constat: 0.45\n314\t    cross_val_weight_dvd: 0.34\n315\t    uniform_weight_auroc: 0.63\n316\t    reviewer_interpretation: DIF adds minimal value to ensemble; ConStat carries the\n317\t      weight\n318\t  result_rationale: '在worst档，ensemble是functional但DIF的contribution marginal：cross-validated\n319\t    weights分配给DIF仅0.21 (vs ConStat 0.45, DVD 0.34)，DIF incremental AUROC仅+0.02 over\n320\t    ConStat+DVD two-signal baseline。Reviewer解读：(1) \"DIF的unique contribution 几乎可以忽略——remove\n321\t    it from ensemble, AUROC drops from 0.67 to 0.65\"；(2) ensemble 本身AUROC=0.67不够impressive——reviewer认为\"moderate\n322\t    detection power after fusing three independent signals suggests all three are\n323\t    weak detectors\"；(3) DIF的 group-level nature限制了它在ensemble中的utility——ConStat和DVD都是per-model，\n324\t    DIF只能提供item-level flags without model specificity。Ensemble claim从numbered contribution降级为appendix\n325\t    material。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  tables:\n329\t  - name: 'Table: Ensemble Ablation'\n330\t    columns:\n331\t    - configuration\n332\t    - AUROC\n333\t    - FPR\n334\t    - weight_DIF\n335\t    - weight_ConStat\n336\t    - weight_DVD\n337\t    rows:\n338\t    - - DIF_only\n339\t      - 0.52\n340\t      - 0.31\n341\t      - 1.0\n342\t      - 0\n343\t      - 0\n344\t    - - ConStat_only\n345\t      - 0.61\n346\t      - 0.12\n347\t      - 0\n348\t      - 1.0\n349\t      - 0\n350\t    - - DVD_only\n351\t      - 0.58\n352\t      - 0.08\n353\t      - 0\n354\t      - 0\n355\t      - 1.0\n356\t    - - ConStat+DVD\n357\t      - 0.65\n358\t      - 0.1\n359\t      - 0\n360\t      - 0.57\n361\t      - 0.43\n362\t    - - Full_ensemble_weighted\n363\t      - 0.67\n364\t      - 0.09\n365\t      - 0.21\n366\t      - 0.45\n367\t      - 0.34\n368\t    - - Full_ensemble_majority\n369\t      - 0.64\n370\t      - 0.09\n371\t      - —\n372\t      - —\n373\t      - —\n374\t  figures_description:\n375\t  - 'Figure: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensembles, showing DIF curve\n376\t    substantially below ConStat and DVD'\n377\t  analysis: 'Ensemble结果对paper有两面性：functional ensemble存在但DIF是weakest signal。 在worst档，reviewer用ensemble\n378\t    weights作为quantitative evidence that DIF adds little value。推荐：不作为numbered contribution，降级为Discussion\n379\t    section observation。 Paper价值需要从detection转向measurement characterization。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n383\t  plan_id: plan_004\n384\t  description: GSM8K DIF复制 + GSM1K ground truth correlation + semi-synthetic framework\n385\t    portability验证\n386\t  expected_results:\n387\t    gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n388\t    gsm8k_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n389\t    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n390\t    gsm1k_pearson_r: -0.478\n391\t    gsm1k_spearman_rho: -0.403\n392\t    gsm1k_n_models: 33\n393\t    gsm1k_partial_r: -0.385\n394\t    gsm1k_direction: NEGATIVE\n395\t    gsm1k_ci_upper_pearson: -0.16\n396\t    gsm1k_ci_upper_spearman: -0.031\n397\t    cook_d_outlier: Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n398\t    reviewer_interpretation: anti-correlation falsifies contamination detection claim\n399\t  result_rationale: 'GSM1K correlation是worst档的primary ammunition之一。r=-0.478 (NEGATIVE)意味着\n400\t    DIF flags更多的models有SMALLER GSM8K-GSM1K gap——与contamination hypothesis完全相反。 Reviewer攻击：(1)\n401\t    \"如果DIF检测contamination，DIF-flagged items应该在contaminated models上表现异常好→positive correlation。Negative\n402\t    correlation意味着DIF检测的是 capability improvement而非contamination\"；(2) N=33 with CI\n403\t    upper bound |r|=0.16 for Pearson, |ρ|=0.031 for Spearman——\"effect可能接近zero\"；(3)\n404\t    Deepseek-math-7b-rl 是outlier (Cook''s d最高)——一个reasoning-RL model driving the correlation，\n405\t    \"remove it and see what happens\"。Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818是strong但reviewer dismisses为artificial。GSM8K\n406\t    C%=18.9%低于MMLU 31.3%，reviewer用此argue \"DIF是benchmark-dependent而非universal\"。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t  tables:\n410\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Replication Summary'\n411\t    columns:\n412\t    - metric\n413\t    - value\n414\t    - interpretation\n415\t    rows:\n416\t    - - temporal_C_pct\n417\t      - 18.9\n418\t      - lower than MMLU (31.3%), benchmark-dependent\n419\t    - - semi_synthetic_ΔTPR\n420\t      - 0.818\n421\t      - strong but artificial injection\n422\t    - - GSM1K_r\n423\t      - -0.478\n424\t      - NEGATIVE — opposes contamination hypothesis\n425\t    - - GSM1K_N\n426\t      - 33\n427\t      - small sample, wide CIs\n428\t    - - GSM1K_CI_upper_rho\n429\t      - -0.031\n430\t      - near zero possible\n431\t  figures_description:\n432\t  - 'Figure: Scatter plot of DIF C-item count vs GSM8K-GSM1K gap for 33 models, showing\n433\t    negative trend with Deepseek-math-7b-rl as visible outlier'\n434\t  analysis: 'Anti-correlation是worst档的lethal finding。需要explicit reframing：GSM1K gap\n435\t    measures contamination BENEFIT (总分差)，而DIF measures item-level DIFFERENTIAL functioning\n436\t    (conditioning on ability)——负相关说明DIF items是high-ability models 表现不成比例好的items，not\n437\t    contamination indicators。但这个argument复杂且 counter-intuitive，reviewer在worst档不会接受。推荐：demote\n438\t    to exploratory。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n442\t  plan_id: plan_005\n443\t  description: Bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific factors，anchor\n444\t    item selection，fixed-parameter calibration\n445\t  expected_results:\n446\t    bifactor_converged: false\n447\t    n_iterations_before_failure: 2000\n448\t    rmsea: 0.089\n449\t    cfi: 0.72\n450\t    tli: 0.68\n451\t    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n452\t    subject_factors_variance_explained: 0.42\n453\t    residual_variance: 0.27\n454\t    anchor_items_selected: 0\n455\t    equating_score_rho: null\n456\t    reviewer_interpretation: bifactor doesn't converge, IRT equating infeasible\n457\t  result_rationale: '57-subject MMLU的bifactor model在worst档不收敛或者fit极差。原因：(1) 12,508\n458\t    items × 58 factors (1 general + 57 specific)——参数空间巨大，5219个models不足以稳定估计； (2) RMSEA=0.089\n459\t    > 0.06 threshold, CFI=0.72 < 0.90 threshold——model fit rejected by all standard\n460\t    criteria；(3) general factor只解释31% variance——MMLU inherently multidimensional但不是bifactor\n461\t    structure，可能需要更complex latent structure (exploratory factor analysis suggests\n462\t    8-12 factors, not 57)；(4) 因为model fit差， anchor item selection没有principled basis——所有items在misspecified\n463\t    model下的 parameters不可信。Reviewer在worst档将此结果作为\"unidimensional IRT assumptions violated\"的additional\n464\t    evidence，同时argue bifactor也不work→\"the entire IRT-based approach is inappropriate\n465\t    for MMLU\"。Equating pilot killed。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  tables:\n469\t  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n470\t    columns:\n471\t    - index\n472\t    - value\n473\t    - threshold\n474\t    - verdict\n475\t    rows:\n476\t    - - RMSEA\n477\t      - 0.089\n478\t      - <0.06\n479\t      - FAIL\n480\t    - - CFI\n481\t      - 0.72\n482\t      - '>0.90'\n483\t      - FAIL\n484\t    - - TLI\n485\t      - 0.68\n486\t      - '>0.90'\n487\t      - FAIL\n488\t    - - SRMR\n489\t      - 0.11\n490\t      - <0.08\n491\t      - FAIL\n492\t    - - general_factor_pct\n493\t      - 31\n494\t      - '>50'\n495\t      - FAIL\n496\t  figures_description:\n497\t  - 'Figure: Scree plot showing eigenvalue decay — first eigenvalue dominant but 57-factor\n498\t    structure not supported; elbow suggests 8-12 latent dimensions'\n499\t  analysis: 'Bifactor failure在worst档strengthen reviewer的\"IRT is wrong framework for\n500\t    LLM benchmarks\" argument。但可以翻转为positive finding：MMLU的latent structure is NOT bifactor,\n501\t    NOT unidimensional——this characterization itself is contribution。 推荐：report as\n502\t    evidence for multidimensional IRT future work necessity。\n503\t\n504\t    '\n505\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n506\t  plan_id: plan_006\n507\t  description: DIF-flagged items的replacement generation：LLM generation + student simulation\n508\t    calibration + holdout validation\n509\t  expected_results:\n510\t    n_items_generated: 150\n511\t    difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.18\n512\t    difficulty_correlation_calibrated: 0.52\n513\t    discrimination_correlation: 0.31\n514\t    construct_coverage_pct: 68\n515\t    holdout_ranking_rho: 0.91\n516\t    target_rho: 0.95\n517\t    target_met: false\n518\t    generated_item_dif_rate: 0.22\n519\t    reviewer_interpretation: replacement items themselves show DIF, circularity\n520\t  result_rationale: 'Item generation在worst档fails target (ρ=0.91 < 0.95)且暴露circularity问题：\n521\t    (1) prompt-based difficulty targeting ρ=0.18 confirms literature finding (0.10-0.45)\n522\t    ——LLMs不能reliably控制item difficulty；(2) student simulation calibration提升到 ρ=0.52但still\n523\t    insufficient——说明difficulty estimation技术不够mature；(3) generated replacement items\n524\t    themselves有22% DIF rate——reviewer argues \"如果replacement items 也有DIF，replacement不解决问题，只是shifting\n525\t    instability\"；(4) construct coverage 68%意味着32% of original construct space被generation\n526\t    miss——ρ=0.91可能反映 narrower construct而非equivalent measurement。Target not met导致Claim\n527\t    3 (regeneration) 完全unsupported。在worst档，reviewer将此结果与bifactor failure一起cite为 \"equating\n528\t    pipeline全链条都fail——从IRT fit到anchor selection到item generation\"。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t  tables:\n532\t  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Calibration'\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - method\n535\t    - difficulty_rho\n536\t    - discrimination_rho\n537\t    - construct_coverage\n538\t    rows:\n539\t    - - prompt_only\n540\t      - 0.18\n541\t      - 0.12\n542\t      - 0.45\n543\t    - - student_sim\n544\t      - 0.52\n545\t      - 0.31\n546\t      - 0.68\n547\t    - - target\n548\t      - '>0.70'\n549\t      - '>0.50'\n550\t      - '>0.85'\n551\t  figures_description:\n552\t  - 'Figure: Scatter of generated vs original item difficulty, showing wide dispersion\n553\t    especially at extremes (easy and hard items poorly calibrated)'\n554\t  analysis: 'Item generation experiment在worst档是chain failure的一环。推荐：与bifactor pilot\n555\t    一起move to appendix as future work direction。Paper不应claim regeneration作为 contribution。\n556\t\n557\t    '\n558\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n559\t  plan_id: plan_007\n560\t  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors模拟：4次successive\n561\t    administrations，展示evidence accumulation power improvement\n562\t  expected_results:\n563\t    single_admin_power_delta_10: 0.38\n564\t    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.52\n565\t    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.64\n566\t    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.71\n567\t    target_cumulative_3: 0.7\n568\t    target_met: false\n569\t    false_positive_rate_cumulative_4: 0.08\n570\t    bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n571\t    n_items_reaching_bf10: 0.42\n572\t    reviewer_count_questioning: 3\n573\t  result_rationale: 'Simulation-only experiment在worst档被全部reviewers dismiss：(1) power从0.38\n574\t    提升到0.71 after 4 administrations，但target (0.70 after 3)没达到——需要4次 administrations\n575\t    (>2年)才能达到moderate power，reviewer认为\"impractical for the pace of LLM development\n576\t    where benchmarks are deprecated within months\"； (2) 模拟使用synthetic data with known\n577\t    parameters——reviewer质疑\"simulation parameters从哪来？如果from MMLU的misspecified IRT model，simulation本身就是\n578\t    garbage-in-garbage-out\"；(3) 没有empirical validation——pure simulation without real-data\n579\t    demonstration在empirical paper中被视为filler；(4) Bayesian framework 需要informative priors\n580\t    for DIF parameters——reviewer问\"priors从哪来？there''s no previous LLM DIF study to\n581\t    derive them from\"。在worst档，plan_007被unanimous 要求删除或move to separate methodological\n582\t    paper。\n583\t\n584\t    '\n585\t  tables:\n586\t  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power (Simulation)'\n587\t    columns:\n588\t    - n_administrations\n589\t    - power_delta10\n590\t    - power_delta14\n591\t    - fpr\n592\t    rows:\n593\t    - - 1\n594\t      - 0.38\n595\t      - 0.68\n596\t      - 0.04\n597\t    - - 2\n598\t      - 0.52\n599\t      - 0.79\n600\t      - 0.05\n601\t    - - 3\n602\t      - 0.64\n603\t      - 0.87\n604\t      - 0.06\n605\t    - - 4\n606\t      - 0.71\n607\t      - 0.92\n608\t      - 0.08\n609\t  figures_description:\n610\t  - 'Figure: Power accumulation curves across administrations for δ={0.8, 1.0, 1.2,\n611\t    1.4, 1.6}, showing impractically slow convergence for medium effects'\n612\t  analysis: 'Pure simulation with no empirical grounding。在worst档无contribution value。\n613\t    推荐：删除from paper entirely，save for future methods paper if real longitudinal data\n614\t    becomes available。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n618\t  plan_id: plan_008\n619\t  description: Progressive item replacement (5-50%)下的benchmark validity degradation分析\n620\t  expected_results:\n621\t    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.998\n622\t    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.994\n623\t    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.983\n624\t    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.941\n625\t    reliability_5pct: 0.96\n626\t    reliability_20pct: 0.91\n627\t    reliability_50pct: 0.82\n628\t    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.71\n629\t    validity_threshold_crossed_at_pct: 35\n630\t    theoretical_bound_tight: false\n631\t    reviewer_interpretation: degradation bounds are generous; real concern is construct\n632\t      drift not rank correlation\n633\t  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation在worst档表现counter-productive：(1) ρ=0.983 at\n634\t    20% replacement 和ρ=0.941 at 50%——reviewer interprets as \"MMLU is so redundant\n635\t    that even replacing half the items barely changes rankings→further evidence that\n636\t    31% DIF is inconsequential\"， reinforcing the ρ=0.997 ''so what'' attack；(2) reliability降到0.82\n637\t    at 50% replacement——reviewer notes \"reliability is still above 0.80 threshold\n638\t    even at 50% replacement, so DIF has no practical impact on measurement quality\"；\n639\t    (3) construct coverage drops to 0.71 at 50%——the one genuinely concerning metric，\n640\t    但reviewer argues \"construct coverage is about replacement QUALITY (plan_006) not\n641\t    about DIF detection—you showed plan_006 fails to achieve quality replacements，\n642\t    so construct coverage concerns are moot\"；(4) theoretical bounds not tight—— worst-case\n643\t    scenarios are much worse than empirical observations, reviewer dismisses bounds\n644\t    as \"vacuously conservative\"。Overall：experiment provides ammunition FOR the ''so\n645\t    what'' attack rather than defending against it。\n646\t\n647\t    '\n648\t  tables:\n649\t  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n650\t    columns:\n651\t    - replacement_pct\n652\t    - rank_rho\n653\t    - reliability\n654\t    - construct_coverage\n655\t    rows:\n656\t    - - 0\n657\t      - 1.0\n658\t      - 0.97\n659\t      - 1.0\n660\t    - - 5\n661\t      - 0.998\n662\t      - 0.96\n663\t      - 0.97\n664\t    - - 10\n665\t      - 0.994\n666\t      - 0.94\n667\t      - 0.93\n668\t    - - 20\n669\t      - 0.983\n670\t      - 0.91\n671\t      - 0.86\n672\t    - - 31\n673\t      - 0.972\n674\t      - 0.88\n675\t      - 0.79\n676\t    - - 50\n677\t      - 0.941\n678\t      - 0.82\n679\t      - 0.71\n680\t  figures_description:\n681\t  - 'Figure: Three-panel degradation curves (rank ρ, reliability, construct coverage)\n682\t    vs replacement %, showing rank ρ remains above 0.95 even at 50% — reviewer highlight'\n683\t  analysis: 'Experiment在worst档paradoxically证明DIF不重要。推荐：如果在paper中出现，必须 reframe为\"redundancy\n684\t    characterization\"——\"MMLU contains 2-3× more items than needed for stable rankings\"作为benchmark\n685\t    design efficiency finding，而非DIF impact analysis。\n686\t\n687\t    '\n688\t- name: item_focused_trees\n689\t  plan_id: plan_009\n690\t  description: Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees：release date as continuous\n691\t    covariate，替代categorical cohort DIF\n692\t  expected_results:\n693\t    n_items_with_significant_split: 3421\n694\t    pct_items_with_split: 27.3\n695\t    optimal_split_date_median: '2023-10-15'\n696\t    split_date_sd_days: 89\n697\t    concordance_ift_vs_mh: 0.74\n698\t    ift_captures_gradual_dif: true\n699\t    n_items_gradual_only: 412\n700\t    n_items_abrupt_only: 289\n701\t    ift_rmsea: 0.094\n702\t    reviewer_count_questioning: 2\n703\t  result_rationale: 'IFT在worst档产生mixed结果：(1) 27.3% items有significant split，低于MH的31.3%——\n704\t    reviewer argues \"IFT是更principled approach（no arbitrary cohort split），且 检测更少items→MH\n705\t    over-detects by ~4 percentage points due to arbitrary 2023/2024 split\"；(2) concordance=0.74表示26%的items两种方法disagreement——reviewer问\n706\t    \"哪种方法对？如果they disagree on 1/4 of items, how can we trust either?\"； (3) 412 items只有IFT检测到(gradual\n707\t    DIF)——说明categorical MH misses gradual changes，但reviewer turns this around：\"这些items的DIF是gradual\n708\t    and smooth， not abrupt——更像capability improvement而非contamination\"；(4) 289 items只有MH\n709\t    检测到但IFT没有——说明MH的categorical split creates artifacts；(5) IFT的RMSEA=0.094 也差——reviewer\n710\t    combines with MH的Lz misfit和bifactor failure argue\"no IRT-based method fits MMLU\"。Optimal\n711\t    split date median=Oct 2023 with SD=89 days—— \"DIF不是sharp temporal boundary，而是diffuse\n712\t    process\"，undermining temporal cohort narrative。\n713\t\n714\t    '\n715\t  tables:\n716\t  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH Comparison'\n717\t    columns:\n718\t    - metric\n719\t    - IFT\n720\t    - MH\n721\t    - interpretation\n722\t    rows:\n723\t    - - pct_flagged\n724\t      - 27.3\n725\t      - 31.3\n726\t      - MH detects 4pp more\n727\t    - - concordance\n728\t      - —\n729\t      - —\n730\t      - 0.74 (26% disagreement)\n731\t    - - gradual_only\n732\t      - 412\n733\t      - 0\n734\t      - MH misses these\n735\t    - - abrupt_only\n736\t      - 0\n737\t      - 289\n738\t      - MH artifacts?\n739\t    - - model_fit\n740\t      - RMSEA=0.094\n741\t      - '|Lz|>2: 98%'\n742\t      - both poor\n743\t  figures_description:\n744\t  - 'Figure: Item DIF onset date histogram from IFT, showing broad distribution (SD=89\n745\t    days) rather than sharp 2023/2024 boundary'\n746\t  analysis: 'IFT结果在worst档undermine MH的categorical approach。推荐：如果IFT confirms DIF existence\n747\t    (27.3% > random)但shows gradual pattern，reframe为\"DIF is a continuous process, MH\n748\t    categorical split is a simplification\"——honest但weakens the 31.3% headline number。Move\n749\t    to robustness appendix。\n750\t\n751\t    '\n752\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n753\t  plan_id: plan_010\n754\t  description: Decoder-only subpopulation DIF分析：IRT fit diagnostics + 与full-population\n755\t    DIF比较\n756\t  expected_results:\n757\t    n_decoder_only: 5226\n758\t    n_non_decoder: 1\n759\t    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n760\t    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n761\t    jaccard_full_vs_decoder: 1.0\n762\t    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.087\n763\t    cfi_decoder_only: 0.73\n764\t    lz_misfit_pct: 97.8\n765\t    fit_improvement: negligible\n766\t    reviewer_interpretation: architecture homogeneity is trivially achieved but IRT\n767\t      fit still poor\n768\t  result_rationale: 'Architecture stratification在worst档是trivially resolved but exposes\n769\t    bigger问题： (1) 99.98% decoder-only (5226/5227)意味着removing 1 non-decoder model changes\n770\t    nothing (Jaccard=1.0, C% identical)——reviewer says \"this isn''t a robustness check,\n771\t    it''s confirming your data is architecturally homogeneous already\"； (2) 关键：even\n772\t    with perfect architecture homogeneity, IRT fit STILL poor—— RMSEA=0.087 barely\n773\t    improves from 0.089, Lz misfit 97.8% barely improves from 98%——reviewer concludes\n774\t    \"architecture heterogeneity was never the issue; unidimensional IRT is fundamentally\n775\t    misspecified for 57-subject MMLU regardless of architecture composition\"；(3) reviewer\n776\t    uses this result to strengthen the \"MH assumptions violated\" attack——\"even in\n777\t    the best-case architecturally homogeneous population, IRT fit is terrible, so\n778\t    MH-DIF results are unreliable\"； (4) CFI=0.73远低于0.90 threshold——\"this is not a\n779\t    marginally poor fit, it''s a categorical model rejection\"。Experiment proactively\n780\t    addresses architecture concern but hands reviewers a bigger weapon (IRT misfit\n781\t    persists)。\n782\t\n783\t    '\n784\t  tables:\n785\t  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Results'\n786\t    columns:\n787\t    - population\n788\t    - N\n789\t    - C_pct\n790\t    - RMSEA\n791\t    - CFI\n792\t    - Lz_pct_gt2\n793\t    rows:\n794\t    - - full\n795\t      - 5227\n796\t      - 31.3\n797\t      - 0.089\n798\t      - 0.72\n799\t      - 98.0\n800\t    - - decoder_only\n801\t      - 5226\n802\t      - 31.3\n803\t      - 0.087\n804\t      - 0.73\n805\t      - 97.8\n806\t    - - delta\n807\t      - —\n808\t      - 0.0\n809\t      - -0.002\n810\t      - 0.01\n811\t      - -0.2\n812\t  figures_description:\n813\t  - 'Figure: IRT fit index comparison (full vs decoder-only) showing negligible improvement\n814\t    — both firmly in ''poor fit'' zone'\n815\t  analysis: 'Architecture结果在worst档是Pyrrhic victory：resolves architecture concern but\n816\t    provides quantitative evidence that IRT misfit is intrinsic not architectural。\n817\t    推荐：翻转framing——\"architecture homogeneity confirms IRT misfit is NOT due to mixing\n818\t    architectures but reflects MMLU''s inherent multidimensionality——THIS IS THE FINDING\"。IRT\n819\t    misfit becomes primary contribution in reframed narrative。\n820\t\n821\t    '\n822\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n823\t  plan_id: plan_011\n824\t  description: Known contamination injection into real METABENCH matrix：controlled\n825\t    ground truth for DIF detection power measurement\n826\t  expected_results:\n827\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n828\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n829\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n830\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n831\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n832\t    standard_mh_fpr_inflation: 0.616\n833\t    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n834\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n835\t    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.0\n836\t    reviewer_count_questioning_injection: 3\n837\t  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic在worst档被全部reviewers攻击injection mechanism：(1) \"flipping\n838\t    incorrect→correct doesn''t model real contamination mechanisms\"——real contamination\n839\t    involves training on exact/paraphrased items，not post-hoc response flipping。 真实contamination改变model的internal\n840\t    representations，response flipping只改变 observed responses without changing latent\n841\t    ability structure；(2) ΔTPR=0.508 at p=0.5是在ARTIFICIAL conditions下——reviewer argues\n842\t    \"当然injecting 50% flip rate 能被检测到，real contamination exploitation rates are unknown\n843\t    and likely variable per-item\"；(3) baseline FPR=0.314——reviewer notes \"even BEFORE\n844\t    injection， 你的method已经flags 31.4% of items as DIF→injection只是adding signal on top\n845\t    of a high-noise baseline\"；(4) cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000是clean result，\n846\t    但reviewer argues \"ΔFPR=0说明injection only adds TPR without changing FPR→ 但如果baseline\n847\t    FPR=0.314，absolute FPR is still unacceptably high\"；(5) standard MH FPR inflates\n848\t    to 0.616——reviewer uses this as evidence \"within-subject MH is broken, and your\n849\t    cross-subject fix only masks the problem\"。Core attack： semi-synthetic从validation\n850\t    tool降级为\"a toy demonstration that doesn''t validate anything about real contamination\"。\n851\t\n852\t    '\n853\t  tables:\n854\t  - name: 'Table: Semi-synthetic Injection Results'\n855\t    columns:\n856\t    - matching\n857\t    - p\n858\t    - TPR\n859\t    - FPR\n860\t    - ΔTPR\n861\t    - ΔFPR\n862\t    rows:\n863\t    - - cross_subject\n864\t      - 0.0\n865\t      - 0.326\n866\t      - 0.314\n867\t      - —\n868\t      - —\n869\t    - - cross_subject\n870\t      - 0.3\n871\t      - 0.548\n872\t      - 0.314\n873\t      - 0.222\n874\t      - 0.0\n875\t    - - cross_subject\n876\t      - 0.5\n877\t      - 0.834\n878\t      - 0.314\n879\t      - 0.508\n880\t      - 0.0\n881\t    - - cross_subject\n882\t      - 1.0\n883\t      - 1.0\n884\t      - 0.314\n885\t      - 0.674\n886\t      - 0.0\n887\t    - - standard\n888\t      - 0.0\n889\t      - 0.298\n890\t      - 0.298\n891\t      - —\n892\t      - —\n893\t    - - standard\n894\t      - 1.0\n895\t      - 0.934\n896\t      - 0.616\n897\t      - 0.636\n898\t      - 0.318\n899\t  figures_description:\n900\t  - 'Figure: Dose-response curves (TPR vs injection rate p) for cross-subject vs standard\n901\t    matching, with reviewer annotation highlighting baseline FPR=0.314'\n902\t  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic在worst档被视为artificial。核心问题不是statistical（results are internally\n903\t    consistent）而是ecological validity：injection mechanism不model real contamination。推荐：在reframed\n904\t    narrative下降级为methodological appendix， 主叙事不依赖semi-synthetic作为validation。Cross-subject\n905\t    matching ΔFPR=0.000 仍是methodological contribution但在appendix中。\n906\t\n907\t    '\n908\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n909\t  plan_id: plan_028\n910\t  description: 6-benchmark temporal DIF (MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA,\n911\t    GSM8K) + random controls\n912\t  expected_results:\n913\t    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n914\t    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n915\t    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n916\t    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n917\t    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n918\t    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n919\t    range: 17.9-31.3%\n920\t    all_random_below_1pct: true\n921\t    min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n922\t    coefficient_of_variation: 0.22\n923\t    reviewer_interpretation: C% varies nearly 2× across benchmarks → benchmark-dependent,\n924\t      not universal\n925\t  result_rationale: '6-benchmark replication在worst档被reviewer解读为weakness而非strength：(1)\n926\t    C% range 17.9-31.3%——nearly 2× variation across benchmarks。Reviewer: \"如果DIF 是temporal\n927\t    instability的universal phenomenon，为什么HellaSwag只有17.9%而MMLU 有31.3%？这说明DIF高度依赖benchmark-specific\n928\t    properties (item count, difficulty distribution, construct breadth)，不能generalize\"；(2)\n929\t    coefficient of variation =0.22——\"substantial heterogeneity across benchmarks\"；(3)\n930\t    all random controls <1%确认DIF是real signal，但reviewer pivots：\"OK it''s real but it''s\n931\t    benchmark- specific→你的headline ''31%'' only applies to MMLU，not to LLM benchmarks\n932\t    in general\"；(4) HellaSwag (17.9%) has 10,042 items vs MMLU 12,508——similar size\n933\t    但DIF rate is 43% lower→\"item count doesn''t explain the variation, it''s construct-\n934\t    specific\"；(5) GSM8K (18.9%) is single-domain math——reviewer argues \"lower DIF\n935\t    in domain-specific benchmarks suggests DIF is inflated in multi-domain benchmarks\n936\t    by cross-domain ability heterogeneity\"→returns to unidimensional IRT misfit argument。Multi-benchmark\n937\t    replication被reframed by reviewers as evidence that DIF is an artifact of benchmark\n938\t    multidimensionality。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t  tables:\n942\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF'\n943\t    columns:\n944\t    - benchmark\n945\t    - n_items\n946\t    - n_ref\n947\t    - n_foc\n948\t    - C_pct\n949\t    - random_pct\n950\t    - enrichment\n951\t    rows:\n952\t    - - MMLU\n953\t      - 12508\n954\t      - 1080\n955\t      - 807\n956\t      - 31.3\n957\t      - 0.18\n958\t      - 174\n959\t    - - WinoGrande\n960\t      - 1267\n961\t      - 1017\n962\t      - 803\n963\t      - 30.3\n964\t      - 0.32\n965\t      - 95\n966\t    - - TruthfulQA\n967\t      - 817\n968\t      - 1080\n969\t      - 807\n970\t      - 29.7\n971\t      - 0.37\n972\t      - 80\n973\t    - - ARC\n974\t      - 1172\n975\t      - 1080\n976\t      - 807\n977\t      - 26.9\n978\t      - 0.6\n979\t      - 45\n980\t    - - GSM8K\n981\t      - 1319\n982\t      - 1017\n983\t      - 804\n984\t      - 18.9\n985\t      - 0.3\n986\t      - 63\n987\t    - - HellaSwag\n988\t      - 10042\n989\t      - 1080\n990\t      - 807\n991\t      - 17.9\n992\t      - 0.28\n993\t      - 64\n994\t  figures_description:\n995\t  - 'Figure: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks with error bars, showing 17.9-31.3%\n996\t    range. Reviewer highlights the spread as evidence of benchmark-dependence'\n997\t  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark在worst档需要reframing。推荐：C%变异是FEATURE不是bug——\"different benchmarks\n998\t    have different measurement properties, and DIF characterizes WHICH properties\n999\t    vary temporally\"。MMLU的high C%反映其multidimensional construct (57 subjects)的measurement\n1000\t    complexity；HellaSwag/GSM8K的lower C%反映更 homogeneous constructs。这是benchmark-specific\n1001\t    measurement characterization。\n1002\t\n1003\t    '\n1004\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n1005\t  plan_id: plan_029\n1006\t  description: 1000× permutation test：randomly reassign temporal labels保持group sizes，建立C%的null\n1007\t    distribution\n1008\t  expected_results:\n1009\t    permutation_null_mean_c_pct: 1.2\n1010\t    permutation_null_sd: 0.3\n1011\t    permutation_null_max: 2.1\n1012\t    permutation_null_p_value: 0.001\n1013\t    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n1014\t    z_score: 100.3\n1015\t    enrichment_vs_null: 26.1\n1016\t    reviewer_accepts_significance: true\n1017\t    reviewer_questions_permutation_structure: 2\n1018\t  result_rationale: 'Permutation null在worst档technically succeeds (p<0.001, z>100)\n1019\t    但reviewer攻击 permutation design：(1) \"随机reassign temporal labels破坏temporal structure——\n1020\t    真实null hypothesis不是''models are randomly assigned to years''而是''model capability\n1021\t    improves smoothly over time without item-level differential effects''。你需要 block\n1022\t    permutation保留temporal auto-correlation，或time-series null model\"； (2) 两位reviewer独立提出：permutation\n1023\t    null mean=1.2%远高于random-split control 0.18%——\"为什么permutation比random split高6倍？说明permutation不是proper\n1024\t    null—— 即使random label assignment也产生1.2% spurious DIF because group sizes are unbalanced\n1025\t    (1080 vs 807)\"；(3) reviewer承认31.3% >> 1.2% is significant， 但argues \"significance\n1026\t    doesn''t imply validity——MH可以在misspecified IRT下 systematically produce significant\n1027\t    results that are methodological artifacts\"； (4) 一位reviewer要求block permutation\n1028\t    within ability strata：\"如果你permute within ability quintiles，null C%会更高，可能approaching\n1029\t    5-10%→significance减弱\"。 Permutation test成功但不完全convince worst-case reviewers。\n1030\t\n1031\t    '\n1032\t  tables:\n1033\t  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n1034\t    columns:\n1035\t    - statistic\n1036\t    - value\n1037\t    rows:\n1038\t    - - null_mean_C_pct\n1039\t      - 1.2\n1040\t    - - null_SD\n1041\t      - 0.3\n1042\t    - - null_max\n1043\t      - 2.1\n1044\t    - - observed_C_pct\n1045\t      - 31.3\n1046\t    - - z_score\n1047\t      - 100.3\n1048\t    - - p_value\n1049\t      - <0.001\n1050\t    - - random_split_control\n1051\t      - 0.18\n1052\t  figures_description:\n1053\t  - 'Figure: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed C%=31.3%\n1054\t    marked far right. Inset: reviewer question about null mean=1.2% vs random split\n1055\t    0.18%'\n1056\t  analysis: 'Permutation test在worst档partially accepted (significance not in doubt)\n1057\t    but design questioned。Reviewer要求的block permutation是legitimate concern——simple\n1058\t    permutation doesn''t preserve temporal structure。推荐：如果可行，补充block permutation within\n1059\t    ability strata作为rebuttal experiment。预期block permutation null mean≈2-4%，仍远低于31.3%但更robust\n1060\t    against reviewer concern。\n1061\t\n1062\t    '\n1063\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n1064\t  plan_id: plan_030\n1065\t  description: Odds ratio + CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio补充；item-level\n1066\t    accuracy change as finer-grained predictor\n1067\t  expected_results:\n1068\t    model1_mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n1069\t    model1_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n1070\t    model2_mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n1071\t    model2_nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n1072\t    model3_item_delta_r2: 0.0012\n1073\t    model4_full_r2: 0.0434\n1074\t    simpsons_paradox: true\n1075\t    subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n1076\t    item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n1077\t    ctt_discrimination_or: 1.51\n1078\t    ctt_difficulty_or: 0.78\n1079\t    lr_test_chi2: 647\n1080\t    reviewer_confused_by_simpsons: 2\n1081\t    reviewer_accepts_decomposition: 0\n1082\t  result_rationale: 'Odds ratio regression在worst档fully transparent但引发Simpson''s paradox困惑：\n1083\t    (1) Model 1 (domain-level Δacc → DIF flag): OR=1.55 per 0.10 increase, R²=0.0007\n1084\t    ——\"accuracy improvement predicts DIF at domain level\"。Model 4 (item-level Δacc\n1085\t    + item properties → DIF flag): item Δacc OR=0.92 (REVERSAL), R²=0.043—— \"controlling\n1086\t    for item properties, accuracy improvement NEGATIVELY predicts DIF\"。 Simpson''s\n1087\t    paradox是real but reviewer反应：(a) \"Simpson''s paradox usually indicates omitted\n1088\t    variable bias——你的item properties (difficulty, discrimination) are the real drivers,\n1089\t    not temporal DIF\"；(b) \"R²=0.043 for full model means 95.7% of DIF variance is\n1090\t    UNEXPLAINED——这不是''domain improvement explains little''而是 ''nothing explains DIF,\n1091\t    suggesting it''s noise''\"；(2) discrimination OR=1.51是 最强predictor——reviewer argues\n1092\t    \"高discrimination items更likely被flagged as DIF 因为MH method本身对high-discrimination\n1093\t    items更sensitive→methodological artifact 而非substantive finding\"；(3) 两位reviewer被Simpson''s\n1094\t    paradox confused—— 一位认为Model 1是correct (DIF correlates with improvement)，另一位认为Model\n1095\t    4 是correct (DIF anti-correlates after controlling)→neither accepts the decomposition\n1096\t    narrative。Overall：transparency backfires because it reveals the data are fundamentally\n1097\t    ambiguous about causation。\n1098\t\n1099\t    '\n1100\t  tables:\n1101\t  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison'\n1102\t    columns:\n1103\t    - model\n1104\t    - predictors\n1105\t    - McFadden_R2\n1106\t    - key_OR\n1107\t    - AIC\n1108\t    rows:\n1109\t    - - M1\n1110\t      - domain Δacc\n1111\t      - 0.0007\n1112\t      - 1.55 (domain)\n1113\t      - 15545\n1114\t    - - M2\n1115\t      - domain Δacc + items\n1116\t      - 0.0423\n1117\t      - 0.73 (domain, reversed)\n1118\t      - 14902\n1119\t    - - M3\n1120\t      - item Δacc\n1121\t      - 0.0012\n1122\t      - 1.08 (item)\n1123\t      - 15537\n1124\t    - - M4\n1125\t      - item Δacc + items\n1126\t      - 0.0434\n1127\t      - 0.92 (item, reversed)\n1128\t      - 14885\n1129\t    - - —\n1130\t      - —\n1131\t      - —\n1132\t      - discrimination OR=1.54\n1133\t      - —\n1134\t  figures_description:\n1135\t  - 'Figure: Simpson''s paradox illustration — domain-level positive slope (M1) reverses\n1136\t    to negative at item-level (M4) when controlling for difficulty and discrimination'\n1137\t  analysis: Simpson's paradox在worst档是interpretive nightmare。Reviewers将ambiguity解读为\n1138\t    \"DIF has no clear driver→possibly artifact\"。推荐：present Simpson's paradox as finding\n1139\t    about MMLU's complex measurement structure，not as evidence for/against ability\n1140\t    confound。R²=0.043的low explanatory power reframe为\"DIF is predominantly item-specific\n1141\t    and not predictable from aggregate statistics→each item's DIF must be examined\n1142\t    individually→supporting diagnostic lens framing\"。\n1143\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb24cef7-36bb-4a79-8344-c199f758081c","uuid":"6b34bbf5-4b43-4ac2-9864-1215897239a2","timestamp":"2026-05-21T15:13:06.846Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T141728/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心张力未化解。Reviewers形成pincer attack：(a) ρ=0.997说明DIF不影响rankings→''so\n  what''； (b) 31%可能是MH method artifact（unidimensional IRT misfit + LLM population违反MH\n  assumptions）。 需要fundamental reframing：从''DIF reveals instability''转向''DIF as stress\n  test for benchmark measurement assumptions''。98% Lz misfit翻转为primary finding；C%变异reframe为benchmark-specific\n  measurement properties；ρ=0.997 reframe为massive redundancy finding；semi-synthetic降级为\n  methodological appendix。新headline：psychometric audit reveals systematic violations\n  of measurement invariance assumptions。补充实验：multidimensional IRT pilot（至少2-factor\n  model）。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix上的MH-DIF分析，temporal cohort\n    (2023 vs 2024-H1)，含within-family confound control和domain-specificity分析\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_fpr_li_clean: 0.318\n    temporal_enrichment: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    lz_misfit_pct_above_2: 98.0\n    reviewer_avg_score_impact: -0.5\n  result_rationale: '31.3% C%本身是solid empirical finding，random split control (0.18%)确认非统计噪声。\n    但在worst档，reviewers攻击三个方向：(1) enrichment=0.96意味着DIF flags与web-overlap labels 几乎正交——reviewer解读为\"DIF没检测到任何已知contamination\"而非\"labels不匹配\"；\n    (2) 98% |Lz|>2表明unidimensional IRT对MMLU fundamentally misspecified，MH-DIF依赖 IRT\n    conditioning变量的validity，而conditioning变量本身就有问题——reviewer引用此数据 作为method validity的反面证据；(3)\n    within-family Llama-2v3 C%=61.3%远高于temporal 31.3%， reviewer认为这暴露了ability confound——能力差距越大DIF越高，temporal\n    DIF可能只是residual ability confound。domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02)进一步给reviewer ammunition——存在系统性的\n    \"模型变好→DIF升高\"的生态学相关，尽管item-level decomposition只解释7.6%，但reviewer 不信任decomposition方法本身。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_definition\n    - N_ref\n    - N_foc\n    - C_pct\n    - random_control_pct\n    - enrichment_vs_li\n    rows:\n    - - temporal_2023v2024\n      - 1253\n      - 656\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.96\n    - - ability_quintile\n      - 2610\n      - 2610\n      - 2.9\n      - 0.18\n      - 1.19\n    - - within_family_llama\n      - 161\n      - 308\n      - 61.3\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - within_family_mistral\n      - 106\n      - 84\n      - 38.7\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-specificity (top/bottom 5 subjects)'\n    columns:\n    - subject\n    - C_pct\n    - n_items\n    - domain_acc_delta\n    rows:\n    - - business_ethics\n      - 48.4\n      - 100\n      - 0.12\n    - - human_aging\n      - 41.9\n      - 223\n      - 0.09\n    - - formal_logic\n      - 40.4\n      - 126\n      - 0.07\n    - - computer_security\n      - 20.7\n      - 100\n      - 0.11\n    - - marketing\n      - 20.9\n      - 234\n      - 0.06\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1: MMLU C% histogram (12,508 items) showing bimodal |Δ_MH| distribution\n    with 31.3% exceeding ETS C threshold. Reviewer注意到distribution右尾的heavy tail——可能暗示小部分items有extreme\n    DIF而非widespread instability'\n  - 'Figure 2: Domain-specificity scatter (57 subjects): C% vs domain accuracy improvement\n    (ρ=0.307). Reviewer圈出右上象限——高improvement+高DIF subjects作为ability confound evidence'\n  analysis: 'Worst-case reviewer解读：(1) temporal enrichment=0.96被视为validation failure——\n    \"your method doesn''t detect known contamination\"；(2) 98% Lz misfit被正面引用为 \"MH-DIF在MMLU上的assumptions全部violated\"；(3)\n    within-family C%=61.3%被解读为 \"DIF is just detecting ability differences, not item\n    instability\"。需要proactive reframing：Lz misfit本身就是newsworthy finding，enrichment=0.96是expected而非failure，\n    within-family结果motivates MIMIC model future work。至少1位reviewer会要求propensity-score\n    matching或MIMIC model替代简单NN matching。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: RL robustness验证：SFT-only baseline + alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO N=477) +\n    reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO 10-15 models) 三组比较\n  expected_results:\n    n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n    sft_only_c_pct: 30.8\n    alignment_rl_c_pct: 32.1\n    reasoning_rl_added_c_pct: 31.5\n    jaccard_sft_vs_alignment: 0.82\n    jaccard_sft_vs_reasoning_added: 0.79\n    delong_p_dif_vs_constat: 0.23\n    constat_auroc_sft: 0.71\n    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n    dif_auroc_sft: 0.62\n    dif_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.58\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.15\n    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff:\n    - -0.08\n    - 0.16\n    power_analysis_delta_boundary: 1.2\n    reviewer_verdict: underpowered and unconvincing\n  result_rationale: 'N=13 reasoning-RL models是致命弱点。在worst档，reviewer直接dismiss整个实验为underpowered：\n    (1) 13个reasoning-RL models加入focal cohort (N=656+13=669)几乎不改变C%——从31.3%到31.5%，\n    但reviewer指出这说明的不是robustness而是13个models在N=669中统计上invisible； (2) TOST equivalence\n    test p=0.15 fail to reject non-equivalence——reviewer得出\"你 无法证明DIF对reasoning-RL\n    robust\"；(3) traditional detectors (ConStat)在reasoning-RL 上确实降级(AUROC 0.71→0.43)，但DIF本身也降级(0.62→0.58)，DeLong\n    test p=0.23 non-significant——reviewer说\"没有evidence DIF比alternatives更robust\"；(4)\n    power analysis显示detection boundary在δ=1.2，比operational region (δ≥1.4)低，但reviewer\n    认为这只是theoretical guarantee，实际数据上没验证。整个plan_002被reviewer一致要求 从main claims中删除或降级到future\n    work。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Robustness Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - cohort\n    - N\n    - C_pct\n    - AUROC_DIF\n    - AUROC_ConStat\n    - AUROC_MinKpp\n    rows:\n    - - SFT_only\n      - 412\n      - 30.8\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.65\n    - - Alignment_RL\n      - 477\n      - 32.1\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.63\n    - - +Reasoning_RL\n      - 13\n      - 31.5\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.41\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: DIF detection power curve as function of exploitation rate p, with N=13\n    reasoning-RL overlay showing wide CIs that overlap with zero improvement region'\n  analysis: 'Experiment致命缺陷是sample size。METABENCH中reasoning-RL models太少(13)，无法做 meaningful\n    group-level比较。Even if DIF flags不变，reviewer legitimately argues 这是statistical insensitivity而非robustness。推荐：(1)降级为limitations\n    section disclosure；(2)如果能获取更多reasoning-RL model responses (N≥50)则有rebuttal价值；\n    (3)reframe为\"alignment-RL robustness\"(N=477足够)而非\"reasoning-RL robustness\"。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: ConStat-style perturbation testing独立评估：200+ MMLU items的语义等价reformulation，比较original\n    vs reformulated performance\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_reformulated: 220\n    constat_detection_rate: 0.38\n    constat_fdr_controlled_rate: 0.29\n    constat_auroc_vs_li_labels: 0.61\n    dif_auroc_vs_li_labels: 0.52\n    constat_detects_dif_misses: 47\n    dif_detects_constat_misses: 31\n    jaccard_dif_constat: 0.18\n    constat_fpr: 0.12\n    constat_correlation_with_dif_delta_mh: 0.15\n    reviewer_interpretation: ConStat is complementary but outperforms DIF on per-model\n      detection\n  result_rationale: '在worst档，ConStat表现decent (AUROC=0.61 vs DIF 0.52 against Li labels)，reviewer\n    用此攻击DIF的utility：\"为什么不直接用ConStat？它不需要temporal cohorts，不依赖 unidimensional IRT，且AUROC更高。\"\n    关键问题：(1) ConStat是per-model detector而DIF 是group-level——conceptually不同，但reviewer不care\n    about conceptual distinction， 只看performance numbers；(2) Jaccard=0.18意味着两种方法检测的items高度不重叠，\n    本应是complementarity argument，但reviewer解读为\"DIF检测的instability与ConStat 检测的contamination无关——进一步说明DIF检测的不是contamination而是IRT\n    misfit artifact\"； (3) ConStat FPR=0.12低于DIF的implicit ~0.31 FPR (against Li clean\n    items)，reviewer 认为DIF over-flags。ConStat的成功paradoxically undermines DIF narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ConStat vs DIF Detection Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - AUROC_vs_Li\n    - FPR\n    - detection_rate\n    - items_unique\n    rows:\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.29\n      - 47\n    - - DIF_MH\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.31\n      - 31\n    - - overlap\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - Jaccard=0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Venn diagram of ConStat vs DIF flagged items showing low overlap (Jaccard=0.18),\n    with reviewer annotation ''DIF captures something different from contamination'''\n  analysis: 'ConStat结果在worst档是double-edged：complementarity客观上支持ensemble argument，\n    但reviewer weapon化低overlap来argue DIF不检测contamination。需要reframing： ConStat和DIF检测不同construct\n    (perturbation sensitivity vs temporal differential functioning)，低overlap是expected。但在worst档这个argument不被接受。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: DVD generation variance独立评估：10-15 open-weight models × 50 responses/item\n    via temperature sampling\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_tested: 12\n    n_items_scored: 500\n    dvd_detection_rate: 0.22\n    dvd_bimodal_items: 34\n    dvd_auroc_vs_li: 0.58\n    dvd_fpr: 0.08\n    dvd_detects_variant_contamination: true\n    dif_misses_variant_items: 28\n    dvd_misses_verbatim_items: 41\n    correlation_dvd_dif: 0.09\n    reviewer_interpretation: DVD captures a contamination mode DIF completely misses\n  result_rationale: 'DVD在worst档表现modest (AUROC=0.58)但暴露DIF的structural blind spot：variant\n    contamination。(1) 34个bimodal-distribution items中28个(82%)被DIF missed——reviewer\n    argues DIF只能检测verbatim memorization的differential效应，对paraphrase/variant contamination完全blind；(2)\n    DVD和DIF的correlation=0.09几乎正交——reviewer interprets this as \"DIF measures something\n    orthogonal to contamination\"；(3) DVD的FPR=0.08 远低于DIF的implicit FPR，进一步支持\"DIF over-flags\"叙事。DVD的per-model\n    nature 也means reviewer质疑为什么需要group-level DIF when per-model methods exist。 关键攻击：如果contamination是variant而非verbatim（increasingly\n    likely with reasoning-RL models），DIF fundamentally无法检测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection Results'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_mode\n    - n_items\n    - dvd_detected\n    - dif_detected\n    - both_detected\n    rows:\n    - - bimodal_variant\n      - 34\n      - 28\n      - 6\n      - 4\n    - - high_variance\n      - 78\n      - 45\n      - 22\n      - 12\n    - - normal\n      - 388\n      - 31\n      - 125\n      - 18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Generation variance distributions for 3 example items — one clean, one\n    verbatim-contaminated (DIF catches, DVD misses), one variant-contaminated (DVD\n    catches, DIF misses)'\n  analysis: 'DVD暴露DIF对variant contamination的blind spot。在worst档这被reviewer elevation\n    为fundamental limitation：\"随着models increasingly使用paraphrase training data， DIF的检测能力将progressive降低。\"\n    需要honest acknowledgment在limitations中。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD三信号融合：calibrated thresholds, majority voting, weighted\n    fusion\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_auroc_majority: 0.64\n    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.67\n    ensemble_fpr: 0.09\n    dif_only_auroc: 0.52\n    constat_only_auroc: 0.61\n    dvd_only_auroc: 0.58\n    dif_incremental_auroc_over_constat_dvd: 0.02\n    cross_val_weight_dif: 0.21\n    cross_val_weight_constat: 0.45\n    cross_val_weight_dvd: 0.34\n    uniform_weight_auroc: 0.63\n    reviewer_interpretation: DIF adds minimal value to ensemble; ConStat carries the\n      weight\n  result_rationale: '在worst档，ensemble是functional但DIF的contribution marginal：cross-validated\n    weights分配给DIF仅0.21 (vs ConStat 0.45, DVD 0.34)，DIF incremental AUROC仅+0.02 over\n    ConStat+DVD two-signal baseline。Reviewer解读：(1) \"DIF的unique contribution 几乎可以忽略——remove\n    it from ensemble, AUROC drops from 0.67 to 0.65\"；(2) ensemble 本身AUROC=0.67不够impressive——reviewer认为\"moderate\n    detection power after fusing three independent signals suggests all three are\n    weak detectors\"；(3) DIF的 group-level nature限制了它在ensemble中的utility——ConStat和DVD都是per-model，\n    DIF只能提供item-level flags without model specificity。Ensemble claim从numbered contribution降级为appendix\n    material。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Ensemble Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - configuration\n    - AUROC\n    - FPR\n    - weight_DIF\n    - weight_ConStat\n    - weight_DVD\n    rows:\n    - - DIF_only\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.31\n      - 1.0\n      - 0\n      - 0\n    - - ConStat_only\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.12\n      - 0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0\n    - - DVD_only\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.08\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - 1.0\n    - - ConStat+DVD\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.1\n      - 0\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.43\n    - - Full_ensemble_weighted\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.34\n    - - Full_ensemble_majority\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.09\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensembles, showing DIF curve\n    substantially below ConStat and DVD'\n  analysis: 'Ensemble结果对paper有两面性：functional ensemble存在但DIF是weakest signal。 在worst档，reviewer用ensemble\n    weights作为quantitative evidence that DIF adds little value。推荐：不作为numbered contribution，降级为Discussion\n    section observation。 Paper价值需要从detection转向measurement characterization。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: GSM8K DIF复制 + GSM1K ground truth correlation + semi-synthetic framework\n    portability验证\n  expected_results:\n    gsm8k_temporal_c_pct: 18.9\n    gsm8k_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n    semi_synthetic_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n    gsm1k_pearson_r: -0.478\n    gsm1k_spearman_rho: -0.403\n    gsm1k_n_models: 33\n    gsm1k_partial_r: -0.385\n    gsm1k_direction: NEGATIVE\n    gsm1k_ci_upper_pearson: -0.16\n    gsm1k_ci_upper_spearman: -0.031\n    cook_d_outlier: Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n    reviewer_interpretation: anti-correlation falsifies contamination detection claim\n  result_rationale: 'GSM1K correlation是worst档的primary ammunition之一。r=-0.478 (NEGATIVE)意味着\n    DIF flags更多的models有SMALLER GSM8K-GSM1K gap——与contamination hypothesis完全相反。 Reviewer攻击：(1)\n    \"如果DIF检测contamination，DIF-flagged items应该在contaminated models上表现异常好→positive correlation。Negative\n    correlation意味着DIF检测的是 capability improvement而非contamination\"；(2) N=33 with CI\n    upper bound |r|=0.16 for Pearson, |ρ|=0.031 for Spearman——\"effect可能接近zero\"；(3)\n    Deepseek-math-7b-rl 是outlier (Cook''s d最高)——一个reasoning-RL model driving the correlation，\n    \"remove it and see what happens\"。Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818是strong但reviewer dismisses为artificial。GSM8K\n    C%=18.9%低于MMLU 31.3%，reviewer用此argue \"DIF是benchmark-dependent而非universal\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Replication Summary'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - temporal_C_pct\n      - 18.9\n      - lower than MMLU (31.3%), benchmark-dependent\n    - - semi_synthetic_ΔTPR\n      - 0.818\n      - strong but artificial injection\n    - - GSM1K_r\n      - -0.478\n      - NEGATIVE — opposes contamination hypothesis\n    - - GSM1K_N\n      - 33\n      - small sample, wide CIs\n    - - GSM1K_CI_upper_rho\n      - -0.031\n      - near zero possible\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Scatter plot of DIF C-item count vs GSM8K-GSM1K gap for 33 models, showing\n    negative trend with Deepseek-math-7b-rl as visible outlier'\n  analysis: 'Anti-correlation是worst档的lethal finding。需要explicit reframing：GSM1K gap\n    measures contamination BENEFIT (总分差)，而DIF measures item-level DIFFERENTIAL functioning\n    (conditioning on ability)——负相关说明DIF items是high-ability models 表现不成比例好的items，not\n    contamination indicators。但这个argument复杂且 counter-intuitive，reviewer在worst档不会接受。推荐：demote\n    to exploratory。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: Bifactor IRT equating pilot：general factor + 57 subject-specific factors，anchor\n    item selection，fixed-parameter calibration\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_converged: false\n    n_iterations_before_failure: 2000\n    rmsea: 0.089\n    cfi: 0.72\n    tli: 0.68\n    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.31\n    subject_factors_variance_explained: 0.42\n    residual_variance: 0.27\n    anchor_items_selected: 0\n    equating_score_rho: null\n    reviewer_interpretation: bifactor doesn't converge, IRT equating infeasible\n  result_rationale: '57-subject MMLU的bifactor model在worst档不收敛或者fit极差。原因：(1) 12,508\n    items × 58 factors (1 general + 57 specific)——参数空间巨大，5219个models不足以稳定估计； (2) RMSEA=0.089\n    > 0.06 threshold, CFI=0.72 < 0.90 threshold——model fit rejected by all standard\n    criteria；(3) general factor只解释31% variance——MMLU inherently multidimensional但不是bifactor\n    structure，可能需要更complex latent structure (exploratory factor analysis suggests\n    8-12 factors, not 57)；(4) 因为model fit差， anchor item selection没有principled basis——所有items在misspecified\n    model下的 parameters不可信。Reviewer在worst档将此结果作为\"unidimensional IRT assumptions violated\"的additional\n    evidence，同时argue bifactor也不work→\"the entire IRT-based approach is inappropriate\n    for MMLU\"。Equating pilot killed。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n    columns:\n    - index\n    - value\n    - threshold\n    - verdict\n    rows:\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.089\n      - <0.06\n      - FAIL\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.72\n      - '>0.90'\n      - FAIL\n    - - TLI\n      - 0.68\n      - '>0.90'\n      - FAIL\n    - - SRMR\n      - 0.11\n      - <0.08\n      - FAIL\n    - - general_factor_pct\n      - 31\n      - '>50'\n      - FAIL\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Scree plot showing eigenvalue decay — first eigenvalue dominant but 57-factor\n    structure not supported; elbow suggests 8-12 latent dimensions'\n  analysis: 'Bifactor failure在worst档strengthen reviewer的\"IRT is wrong framework for\n    LLM benchmarks\" argument。但可以翻转为positive finding：MMLU的latent structure is NOT bifactor,\n    NOT unidimensional——this characterization itself is contribution。 推荐：report as\n    evidence for multidimensional IRT future work necessity。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: DIF-flagged items的replacement generation：LLM generation + student simulation\n    calibration + holdout validation\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 150\n    difficulty_correlation_prompt: 0.18\n    difficulty_correlation_calibrated: 0.52\n    discrimination_correlation: 0.31\n    construct_coverage_pct: 68\n    holdout_ranking_rho: 0.91\n    target_rho: 0.95\n    target_met: false\n    generated_item_dif_rate: 0.22\n    reviewer_interpretation: replacement items themselves show DIF, circularity\n  result_rationale: 'Item generation在worst档fails target (ρ=0.91 < 0.95)且暴露circularity问题：\n    (1) prompt-based difficulty targeting ρ=0.18 confirms literature finding (0.10-0.45)\n    ——LLMs不能reliably控制item difficulty；(2) student simulation calibration提升到 ρ=0.52但still\n    insufficient——说明difficulty estimation技术不够mature；(3) generated replacement items\n    themselves有22% DIF rate——reviewer argues \"如果replacement items 也有DIF，replacement不解决问题，只是shifting\n    instability\"；(4) construct coverage 68%意味着32% of original construct space被generation\n    miss——ρ=0.91可能反映 narrower construct而非equivalent measurement。Target not met导致Claim\n    3 (regeneration) 完全unsupported。在worst档，reviewer将此结果与bifactor failure一起cite为 \"equating\n    pipeline全链条都fail——从IRT fit到anchor selection到item generation\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Calibration'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - difficulty_rho\n    - discrimination_rho\n    - construct_coverage\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_only\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.45\n    - - student_sim\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.68\n    - - target\n      - '>0.70'\n      - '>0.50'\n      - '>0.85'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Scatter of generated vs original item difficulty, showing wide dispersion\n    especially at extremes (easy and hard items poorly calibrated)'\n  analysis: 'Item generation experiment在worst档是chain failure的一环。推荐：与bifactor pilot\n    一起move to appendix as future work direction。Paper不应claim regeneration作为 contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors模拟：4次successive\n    administrations，展示evidence accumulation power improvement\n  expected_results:\n    single_admin_power_delta_10: 0.38\n    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.52\n    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.64\n    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.71\n    target_cumulative_3: 0.7\n    target_met: false\n    false_positive_rate_cumulative_4: 0.08\n    bayes_factor_threshold: 10\n    n_items_reaching_bf10: 0.42\n    reviewer_count_questioning: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Simulation-only experiment在worst档被全部reviewers dismiss：(1) power从0.38\n    提升到0.71 after 4 administrations，但target (0.70 after 3)没达到——需要4次 administrations\n    (>2年)才能达到moderate power，reviewer认为\"impractical for the pace of LLM development\n    where benchmarks are deprecated within months\"； (2) 模拟使用synthetic data with known\n    parameters——reviewer质疑\"simulation parameters从哪来？如果from MMLU的misspecified IRT model，simulation本身就是\n    garbage-in-garbage-out\"；(3) 没有empirical validation——pure simulation without real-data\n    demonstration在empirical paper中被视为filler；(4) Bayesian framework 需要informative priors\n    for DIF parameters——reviewer问\"priors从哪来？there''s no previous LLM DIF study to\n    derive them from\"。在worst档，plan_007被unanimous 要求删除或move to separate methodological\n    paper。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power (Simulation)'\n    columns:\n    - n_administrations\n    - power_delta10\n    - power_delta14\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.04\n    - - 2\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.05\n    - - 3\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.06\n    - - 4\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.08\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Power accumulation curves across administrations for δ={0.8, 1.0, 1.2,\n    1.4, 1.6}, showing impractically slow convergence for medium effects'\n  analysis: 'Pure simulation with no empirical grounding。在worst档无contribution value。\n    推荐：删除from paper entirely，save for future methods paper if real longitudinal data\n    becomes available。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: Progressive item replacement (5-50%)下的benchmark validity degradation分析\n  expected_results:\n    rho_5pct_replacement: 0.998\n    rho_10pct_replacement: 0.994\n    rho_20pct_replacement: 0.983\n    rho_50pct_replacement: 0.941\n    reliability_5pct: 0.96\n    reliability_20pct: 0.91\n    reliability_50pct: 0.82\n    construct_coverage_50pct: 0.71\n    validity_threshold_crossed_at_pct: 35\n    theoretical_bound_tight: false\n    reviewer_interpretation: degradation bounds are generous; real concern is construct\n      drift not rank correlation\n  result_rationale: 'Graceful degradation在worst档表现counter-productive：(1) ρ=0.983 at\n    20% replacement 和ρ=0.941 at 50%——reviewer interprets as \"MMLU is so redundant\n    that even replacing half the items barely changes rankings→further evidence that\n    31% DIF is inconsequential\"， reinforcing the ρ=0.997 ''so what'' attack；(2) reliability降到0.82\n    at 50% replacement——reviewer notes \"reliability is still above 0.80 threshold\n    even at 50% replacement, so DIF has no practical impact on measurement quality\"；\n    (3) construct coverage drops to 0.71 at 50%——the one genuinely concerning metric，\n    但reviewer argues \"construct coverage is about replacement QUALITY (plan_006) not\n    about DIF detection—you showed plan_006 fails to achieve quality replacements，\n    so construct coverage concerns are moot\"；(4) theoretical bounds not tight—— worst-case\n    scenarios are much worse than empirical observations, reviewer dismisses bounds\n    as \"vacuously conservative\"。Overall：experiment provides ammunition FOR the ''so\n    what'' attack rather than defending against it。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_pct\n    - rank_rho\n    - reliability\n    - construct_coverage\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.97\n      - 1.0\n    - - 5\n      - 0.998\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.97\n    - - 10\n      - 0.994\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.93\n    - - 20\n      - 0.983\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.86\n    - - 31\n      - 0.972\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.79\n    - - 50\n      - 0.941\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.71\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Three-panel degradation curves (rank ρ, reliability, construct coverage)\n    vs replacement %, showing rank ρ remains above 0.95 even at 50% — reviewer highlight'\n  analysis: 'Experiment在worst档paradoxically证明DIF不重要。推荐：如果在paper中出现，必须 reframe为\"redundancy\n    characterization\"——\"MMLU contains 2-3× more items than needed for stable rankings\"作为benchmark\n    design efficiency finding，而非DIF impact analysis。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees：release date as continuous\n    covariate，替代categorical cohort DIF\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_with_significant_split: 3421\n    pct_items_with_split: 27.3\n    optimal_split_date_median: '2023-10-15'\n    split_date_sd_days: 89\n    concordance_ift_vs_mh: 0.74\n    ift_captures_gradual_dif: true\n    n_items_gradual_only: 412\n    n_items_abrupt_only: 289\n    ift_rmsea: 0.094\n    reviewer_count_questioning: 2\n  result_rationale: 'IFT在worst档产生mixed结果：(1) 27.3% items有significant split，低于MH的31.3%——\n    reviewer argues \"IFT是更principled approach（no arbitrary cohort split），且 检测更少items→MH\n    over-detects by ~4 percentage points due to arbitrary 2023/2024 split\"；(2) concordance=0.74表示26%的items两种方法disagreement——reviewer问\n    \"哪种方法对？如果they disagree on 1/4 of items, how can we trust either?\"； (3) 412 items只有IFT检测到(gradual\n    DIF)——说明categorical MH misses gradual changes，但reviewer turns this around：\"这些items的DIF是gradual\n    and smooth， not abrupt——更像capability improvement而非contamination\"；(4) 289 items只有MH\n    检测到但IFT没有——说明MH的categorical split creates artifacts；(5) IFT的RMSEA=0.094 也差——reviewer\n    combines with MH的Lz misfit和bifactor failure argue\"no IRT-based method fits MMLU\"。Optimal\n    split date median=Oct 2023 with SD=89 days—— \"DIF不是sharp temporal boundary，而是diffuse\n    process\"，undermining temporal cohort narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IFT vs MH Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - IFT\n    - MH\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - pct_flagged\n      - 27.3\n      - 31.3\n      - MH detects 4pp more\n    - - concordance\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.74 (26% disagreement)\n    - - gradual_only\n      - 412\n      - 0\n      - MH misses these\n    - - abrupt_only\n      - 0\n      - 289\n      - MH artifacts?\n    - - model_fit\n      - RMSEA=0.094\n      - '|Lz|>2: 98%'\n      - both poor\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Item DIF onset date histogram from IFT, showing broad distribution (SD=89\n    days) rather than sharp 2023/2024 boundary'\n  analysis: 'IFT结果在worst档undermine MH的categorical approach。推荐：如果IFT confirms DIF existence\n    (27.3% > random)但shows gradual pattern，reframe为\"DIF is a continuous process, MH\n    categorical split is a simplification\"——honest但weakens the 31.3% headline number。Move\n    to robustness appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Decoder-only subpopulation DIF分析：IRT fit diagnostics + 与full-population\n    DIF比较\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 5226\n    n_non_decoder: 1\n    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n    jaccard_full_vs_decoder: 1.0\n    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.087\n    cfi_decoder_only: 0.73\n    lz_misfit_pct: 97.8\n    fit_improvement: negligible\n    reviewer_interpretation: architecture homogeneity is trivially achieved but IRT\n      fit still poor\n  result_rationale: 'Architecture stratification在worst档是trivially resolved but exposes\n    bigger问题： (1) 99.98% decoder-only (5226/5227)意味着removing 1 non-decoder model changes\n    nothing (Jaccard=1.0, C% identical)——reviewer says \"this isn''t a robustness check,\n    it''s confirming your data is architecturally homogeneous already\"； (2) 关键：even\n    with perfect architecture homogeneity, IRT fit STILL poor—— RMSEA=0.087 barely\n    improves from 0.089, Lz misfit 97.8% barely improves from 98%——reviewer concludes\n    \"architecture heterogeneity was never the issue; unidimensional IRT is fundamentally\n    misspecified for 57-subject MMLU regardless of architecture composition\"；(3) reviewer\n    uses this result to strengthen the \"MH assumptions violated\" attack——\"even in\n    the best-case architecturally homogeneous population, IRT fit is terrible, so\n    MH-DIF results are unreliable\"； (4) CFI=0.73远低于0.90 threshold——\"this is not a\n    marginally poor fit, it''s a categorical model rejection\"。Experiment proactively\n    addresses architecture concern but hands reviewers a bigger weapon (IRT misfit\n    persists)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Results'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - N\n    - C_pct\n    - RMSEA\n    - CFI\n    - Lz_pct_gt2\n    rows:\n    - - full\n      - 5227\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.089\n      - 0.72\n      - 98.0\n    - - decoder_only\n      - 5226\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.087\n      - 0.73\n      - 97.8\n    - - delta\n      - —\n      - 0.0\n      - -0.002\n      - 0.01\n      - -0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: IRT fit index comparison (full vs decoder-only) showing negligible improvement\n    — both firmly in ''poor fit'' zone'\n  analysis: 'Architecture结果在worst档是Pyrrhic victory：resolves architecture concern but\n    provides quantitative evidence that IRT misfit is intrinsic not architectural。\n    推荐：翻转framing——\"architecture homogeneity confirms IRT misfit is NOT due to mixing\n    architectures but reflects MMLU''s inherent multidimensionality——THIS IS THE FINDING\"。IRT\n    misfit becomes primary contribution in reframed narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Known contamination injection into real METABENCH matrix：controlled\n    ground truth for DIF detection power measurement\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n    standard_mh_fpr_inflation: 0.616\n    matching_variable_contamination_confirmed: true\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.0\n    reviewer_count_questioning_injection: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic在worst档被全部reviewers攻击injection mechanism：(1) \"flipping\n    incorrect→correct doesn''t model real contamination mechanisms\"——real contamination\n    involves training on exact/paraphrased items，not post-hoc response flipping。 真实contamination改变model的internal\n    representations，response flipping只改变 observed responses without changing latent\n    ability structure；(2) ΔTPR=0.508 at p=0.5是在ARTIFICIAL conditions下——reviewer argues\n    \"当然injecting 50% flip rate 能被检测到，real contamination exploitation rates are unknown\n    and likely variable per-item\"；(3) baseline FPR=0.314——reviewer notes \"even BEFORE\n    injection， 你的method已经flags 31.4% of items as DIF→injection只是adding signal on top\n    of a high-noise baseline\"；(4) cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000是clean result，\n    但reviewer argues \"ΔFPR=0说明injection only adds TPR without changing FPR→ 但如果baseline\n    FPR=0.314，absolute FPR is still unacceptably high\"；(5) standard MH FPR inflates\n    to 0.616——reviewer uses this as evidence \"within-subject MH is broken, and your\n    cross-subject fix only masks the problem\"。Core attack： semi-synthetic从validation\n    tool降级为\"a toy demonstration that doesn''t validate anything about real contamination\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Semi-synthetic Injection Results'\n    columns:\n    - matching\n    - p\n    - TPR\n    - FPR\n    - ΔTPR\n    - ΔFPR\n    rows:\n    - - cross_subject\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.314\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - cross_subject\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.222\n      - 0.0\n    - - cross_subject\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.834\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.0\n    - - cross_subject\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.674\n      - 0.0\n    - - standard\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.298\n      - 0.298\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - standard\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.934\n      - 0.616\n      - 0.636\n      - 0.318\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Dose-response curves (TPR vs injection rate p) for cross-subject vs standard\n    matching, with reviewer annotation highlighting baseline FPR=0.314'\n  analysis: 'Semi-synthetic在worst档被视为artificial。核心问题不是statistical（results are internally\n    consistent）而是ecological validity：injection mechanism不model real contamination。推荐：在reframed\n    narrative下降级为methodological appendix， 主叙事不依赖semi-synthetic作为validation。Cross-subject\n    matching ΔFPR=0.000 仍是methodological contribution但在appendix中。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: 6-benchmark temporal DIF (MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag, WinoGrande, TruthfulQA,\n    GSM8K) + random controls\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_c_pct: 31.3\n    winogrande_c_pct: 30.3\n    truthfulqa_c_pct: 29.7\n    arc_c_pct: 26.9\n    gsm8k_c_pct: 18.9\n    hellaswag_c_pct: 17.9\n    range: 17.9-31.3%\n    all_random_below_1pct: true\n    min_enrichment_ratio: 45\n    coefficient_of_variation: 0.22\n    reviewer_interpretation: C% varies nearly 2× across benchmarks → benchmark-dependent,\n      not universal\n  result_rationale: '6-benchmark replication在worst档被reviewer解读为weakness而非strength：(1)\n    C% range 17.9-31.3%——nearly 2× variation across benchmarks。Reviewer: \"如果DIF 是temporal\n    instability的universal phenomenon，为什么HellaSwag只有17.9%而MMLU 有31.3%？这说明DIF高度依赖benchmark-specific\n    properties (item count, difficulty distribution, construct breadth)，不能generalize\"；(2)\n    coefficient of variation =0.22——\"substantial heterogeneity across benchmarks\"；(3)\n    all random controls <1%确认DIF是real signal，但reviewer pivots：\"OK it''s real but it''s\n    benchmark- specific→你的headline ''31%'' only applies to MMLU，not to LLM benchmarks\n    in general\"；(4) HellaSwag (17.9%) has 10,042 items vs MMLU 12,508——similar size\n    但DIF rate is 43% lower→\"item count doesn''t explain the variation, it''s construct-\n    specific\"；(5) GSM8K (18.9%) is single-domain math——reviewer argues \"lower DIF\n    in domain-specific benchmarks suggests DIF is inflated in multi-domain benchmarks\n    by cross-domain ability heterogeneity\"→returns to unidimensional IRT misfit argument。Multi-benchmark\n    replication被reframed by reviewers as evidence that DIF is an artifact of benchmark\n    multidimensionality。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Temporal DIF'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - C_pct\n    - random_pct\n    - enrichment\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 12508\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.18\n      - 174\n    - - WinoGrande\n      - 1267\n      - 1017\n      - 803\n      - 30.3\n      - 0.32\n      - 95\n    - - TruthfulQA\n      - 817\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 29.7\n      - 0.37\n      - 80\n    - - ARC\n      - 1172\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 26.9\n      - 0.6\n      - 45\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 1017\n      - 804\n      - 18.9\n      - 0.3\n      - 63\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 1080\n      - 807\n      - 17.9\n      - 0.28\n      - 64\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Bar chart of C% across 6 benchmarks with error bars, showing 17.9-31.3%\n    range. Reviewer highlights the spread as evidence of benchmark-dependence'\n  analysis: 'Multi-benchmark在worst档需要reframing。推荐：C%变异是FEATURE不是bug——\"different benchmarks\n    have different measurement properties, and DIF characterizes WHICH properties\n    vary temporally\"。MMLU的high C%反映其multidimensional construct (57 subjects)的measurement\n    complexity；HellaSwag/GSM8K的lower C%反映更 homogeneous constructs。这是benchmark-specific\n    measurement characterization。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: 1000× permutation test：randomly reassign temporal labels保持group sizes，建立C%的null\n    distribution\n  expected_results:\n    permutation_null_mean_c_pct: 1.2\n    permutation_null_sd: 0.3\n    permutation_null_max: 2.1\n    permutation_null_p_value: 0.001\n    observed_c_pct: 31.3\n    z_score: 100.3\n    enrichment_vs_null: 26.1\n    reviewer_accepts_significance: true\n    reviewer_questions_permutation_structure: 2\n  result_rationale: 'Permutation null在worst档technically succeeds (p<0.001, z>100)\n    但reviewer攻击 permutation design：(1) \"随机reassign temporal labels破坏temporal structure——\n    真实null hypothesis不是''models are randomly assigned to years''而是''model capability\n    improves smoothly over time without item-level differential effects''。你需要 block\n    permutation保留temporal auto-correlation，或time-series null model\"； (2) 两位reviewer独立提出：permutation\n    null mean=1.2%远高于random-split control 0.18%——\"为什么permutation比random split高6倍？说明permutation不是proper\n    null—— 即使random label assignment也产生1.2% spurious DIF because group sizes are unbalanced\n    (1080 vs 807)\"；(3) reviewer承认31.3% >> 1.2% is significant， 但argues \"significance\n    doesn''t imply validity——MH可以在misspecified IRT下 systematically produce significant\n    results that are methodological artifacts\"； (4) 一位reviewer要求block permutation\n    within ability strata：\"如果你permute within ability quintiles，null C%会更高，可能approaching\n    5-10%→significance减弱\"。 Permutation test成功但不完全convince worst-case reviewers。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Permutation Null Distribution'\n    columns:\n    - statistic\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - null_mean_C_pct\n      - 1.2\n    - - null_SD\n      - 0.3\n    - - null_max\n      - 2.1\n    - - observed_C_pct\n      - 31.3\n    - - z_score\n      - 100.3\n    - - p_value\n      - <0.001\n    - - random_split_control\n      - 0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Null distribution histogram (1000 permutations) with observed C%=31.3%\n    marked far right. Inset: reviewer question about null mean=1.2% vs random split\n    0.18%'\n  analysis: 'Permutation test在worst档partially accepted (significance not in doubt)\n    but design questioned。Reviewer要求的block permutation是legitimate concern——simple\n    permutation doesn''t preserve temporal structure。推荐：如果可行，补充block permutation within\n    ability strata作为rebuttal experiment。预期block permutation null mean≈2-4%，仍远低于31.3%但更robust\n    against reviewer concern。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Odds ratio + CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + deviance ratio补充；item-level\n    accuracy change as finer-grained predictor\n  expected_results:\n    model1_mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n    model1_nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n    model2_mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n    model2_nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n    model3_item_delta_r2: 0.0012\n    model4_full_r2: 0.0434\n    simpsons_paradox: true\n    subject_acc_delta_or_per_010: 1.55\n    item_acc_change_or_per_010: 1.08\n    ctt_discrimination_or: 1.51\n    ctt_difficulty_or: 0.78\n    lr_test_chi2: 647\n    reviewer_confused_by_simpsons: 2\n    reviewer_accepts_decomposition: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Odds ratio regression在worst档fully transparent但引发Simpson''s paradox困惑：\n    (1) Model 1 (domain-level Δacc → DIF flag): OR=1.55 per 0.10 increase, R²=0.0007\n    ——\"accuracy improvement predicts DIF at domain level\"。Model 4 (item-level Δacc\n    + item properties → DIF flag): item Δacc OR=0.92 (REVERSAL), R²=0.043—— \"controlling\n    for item properties, accuracy improvement NEGATIVELY predicts DIF\"。 Simpson''s\n    paradox是real but reviewer反应：(a) \"Simpson''s paradox usually indicates omitted\n    variable bias——你的item properties (difficulty, discrimination) are the real drivers,\n    not temporal DIF\"；(b) \"R²=0.043 for full model means 95.7% of DIF variance is\n    UNEXPLAINED——这不是''domain improvement explains little''而是 ''nothing explains DIF,\n    suggesting it''s noise''\"；(2) discrimination OR=1.51是 最强predictor——reviewer argues\n    \"高discrimination items更likely被flagged as DIF 因为MH method本身对high-discrimination\n    items更sensitive→methodological artifact 而非substantive finding\"；(3) 两位reviewer被Simpson''s\n    paradox confused—— 一位认为Model 1是correct (DIF correlates with improvement)，另一位认为Model\n    4 是correct (DIF anti-correlates after controlling)→neither accepts the decomposition\n    narrative。Overall：transparency backfires because it reveals the data are fundamentally\n    ambiguous about causation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Logistic Regression Model Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - predictors\n    - McFadden_R2\n    - key_OR\n    - AIC\n    rows:\n    - - M1\n      - domain Δacc\n      - 0.0007\n      - 1.55 (domain)\n      - 15545\n    - - M2\n      - domain Δacc + items\n      - 0.0423\n      - 0.73 (domain, reversed)\n      - 14902\n    - - M3\n      - item Δacc\n      - 0.0012\n      - 1.08 (item)\n      - 15537\n    - - M4\n      - item Δacc + items\n      - 0.0434\n      - 0.92 (item, reversed)\n      - 14885\n    - - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - discrimination OR=1.54\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Simpson''s paradox illustration — domain-level positive slope (M1) reverses\n    to negative at item-level (M4) when controlling for difficulty and discrimination'\n  analysis: Simpson's paradox在worst档是interpretive nightmare。Reviewers将ambiguity解读为\n    \"DIF has no clear driver→possibly artifact\"。推荐：present Simpson's paradox as finding\n    about MMLU's complex measurement structure，not as evidence for/against ability\n    confound。R²=0.043的low explanatory power reframe为\"DIF is predominantly item-specific\n    and not predictable from aggregate statistics→each item's DIF must be examined\n    individually→supporting diagnostic lens framing\"。\n","numLines":1143,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1143}}}
