{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0131tuhY1NU8hg3eNqgi4zna","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 29\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP DIF 检测采用 ETS C 分类（效应量+显著性双阈值）替代 BH 校正 p 值作为主判定标准\\\\n  rationale: Monte Carlo 模拟显示 BH 校正在 200 items 场景下将 TPR 压缩 40-60%，所有核心条件均 FAIL/GRAY。但\\\\n    ETS C 分类（|Δ_MH|≥1.5 + 显著性，教育测量 gold standard）在 N≥80, δ≥1.4 时 TPR=0.72-0.85, FPR<0.05，满足\\\\n    pass criteria。ETS C 是 DIF 领域标准实践（Holland & Thayer 1988），使用效应量阈值比纯 p 值更稳健。操作点 N≥80,\\\\n    δ≥1.4 与 GSM1K 文档的重度污染效应量吻合。小效应由 ensemble 其他信号覆盖。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'BH-corrected: all FAIL/GRAY; ETS C: PASS at N≥80,δ≥1.4 (TPR=0.72-0.85,\\\\n      FPR<0.05)'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 19:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过：DIF+ETS C 在 N≥80,δ≥1.4 下功效达标，推荐 N≥100 为主操作点\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 合成参数 + Phase 2 真实参数（PSN-IRT）均验证 ETS C TPR≥0.65 at N≥80,δ≥1.4。Phase\\\\n    2 比 Phase 1 降低 3-6pp 符合预期。N=80,δ=1.4 裕度仅 0.032，推荐 N≥100 为主 claim。数据源为 PSN-IRT\\\\n    而非 ROADMAP 指定的 METABENCH，research 阶段需用 METABENCH 补充验证。限制：δ<1.0 需 ensemble 其他信号。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 1 conditional pass: ETS C TPR=0.72-0.85 at N≥80,δ≥1.4'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 2 pass: ETS C TPR=0.68-0.80 at N≥80,δ≥1.4 with real MMLU params'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 20:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream analysis (dream_20260520T194223): 6 confirmed actions from cross-tier\\\\n    synthesis, 2 new experiments added (plan_010/011), framing qualified'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream scores met thresholds (best=4/6, median=3.5/6, worst=3/6). Cross-tier\\\\n    analysis identified 6 confirmed issues (≥2 tiers): (1) contamination-capability\\\\n    confound → within-family analysis added to plan_001; (2) RL evidence underpowered\\\\n    → bootstrap CIs + equivalence testing added to plan_002; (3) partial exploitation\\\\n    gap → power analysis added to plan_002; (4) ground truth circularity → plan_011\\\\n    semi-synthetic validation added; (5) related work thin → Paper Agent writing-phase\\\\n    task; (6) Growing Pains differentiation → Paper Agent task. Additionally: plan_010\\\\n    architecture-stratified DIF added as P1 proactive defense from worst-case; novelty\\\\n    claim qualified from \\\\\\\"first self-healing benchmark\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"psychometric monitoring\\\\n    framework\\\\\\\". Re-dream required before P0 approval.'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 temporal cohort DIF 证伪（enrichment=0.96），根因是 impact vs DIF 混淆。批准\\\\n    matched-ability DIF 作为方法改进方向 1\\\\n  rationale: Temporal cohort MH-DIF 标记 31.3% items 为 ETS C，但 enrichment=0.96（clean\\\\n    和 contaminated 标记概率相同）—— DIF 检测的是系统性能力提升而非污染。Within-family (Llama-2 vs Llama-3)\\\\n    61.3% C 进一步证实。这是经典 impact vs DIF 混淆（Dream D2 预测过）。但 ability-quintile enrichment=1.19\\\\n    + FPR=2.7% 表明信号存在但弱。方向1 matched-ability temporal DIF 在 quintile 内做时间对比，是最快验证能力匹配能否放大信号的路径。方向2\\\\n    IRT equating 并行准备作为 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - temporal cohort enrichment 0.96, ability quintile enrichment\\\\n      1.19\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 方向 1 (matched-ability DIF) 失败确认，所有 quintile enrichment 0.94-1.04。plan_011\\\\n    是唯一决定性实验\\\\n  rationale: Quintile 内 temporal DIF 仍 enrichment≈1.0，ability matching 未能分离污染信号。但\\\\n    Reviewer 指出关键洞察：Li et al. web-overlap 是全局性污染（Common Crawl 对所有模型可用），不应产生 group-specific\\\\n    DIF。enrichment≈1.0 可能是 ground truth 不匹配而非方法失败。plan_011 注入的是已知差异性污染（仅 focal group），是唯一能区分\\\\\\\"DIF\\\\n    不 work\\\\\\\"和\\\\\\\"ground truth 不对\\\\\\\"的实验。方向 2 (IRT θ-matching) 如果问题出在 ground truth 也无法解决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001b_matched_ability_dif\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - all quintiles enrichment 0.94-1.04\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_011 positive: MH-DIF 检测差异性污染有效 (p=0.5 TPR=0.834, p=1.0 TPR=1.0)，但\\\\n    baseline FPR=31% 需 IRT θ-conditioning 降低。启动方向 2'\\\\n  rationale: Semi-synthetic validation 确认 DIF 能检测差异性污染（剂量-响应单调，Fisher p<1e-21）。plan_001/001b\\\\n    失败归因于 Li et al. web-overlap 是全局性标注，不产生 group-specific DIF。但 baseline FPR=31% (temporal)\\\\n    / 49% (ability) 意味着 DIF 是筛查工具（高召回、中等精度），不是确诊工具。Precision ~44% at p=1.0。两个推进方向：(1)\\\\n    IRT θ-conditioning 降低 baseline FPR (方向 2)，(2) Ensemble 信号 (Claim 2) 过滤假阳性——DIF\\\\n    高召回 + ConStat 高精度自然衔接。同时需 Yen's Q3 诊断局部独立性（审稿 WC4），局部依赖可能是 FPR 膨胀的部分原因。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive - TPR 0.834 at p=0.5, 1.0 at p=1.0; but baseline FPR 0.314\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 21:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Story pivot: semi-synthetic validation 作为核心效度证据，Li et al. enrichment≈1.0\\\\n    重新定位为\\\\\\\"全局 vs 差异性污染\\\\\\\"的发现。IRT θ-conditioning 继续（降 FPR），但不期望改善 Li enrichment'\\\\n  rationale: 'Agent 和 Reviewer 均指出：即使 IRT θ 完美控制能力，Li et al. web-overlap 仍是全局标注，enrichment\\\\n    仍≈1.0。plan_011 semi-synthetic (ΔTPR=+0.674, Fisher p<1e-42) 是 DIF 方法有效性的决定性证据。Li\\\\n    et al. enrichment≈1.0 不是方法失败，而是揭示了现有\\\\\\\"污染标注\\\\\\\"实际测量的是全局 web 曝光（所有模型共享），不是差异性训练数据包含。这是一个有价值的发现：DIF\\\\n    检测差异性污染，现有标签标注存在性污染，两者度量不同。Story: DIF 是差异性污染的高灵敏度筛查工具 + ensemble 提升精度 + 全局/差异性污染区分是方法论贡献。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - reinterpreted as ground truth mismatch\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001b_matched_ability_dif\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - reinterpreted as ground truth mismatch\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 22:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 方向 2 (IRT θ-conditioning) 失败，1D 路线穷尽。plan_011 ability cohort TPR 修正（76%→21%，73%\\\\n    是能力混淆）。启动 plan_005 bifactor IRT 作为最后结构性改进\\\\n  rationale: logit(p) 与 total score 相关 0.9986，所有 θ 变体 FPR 31-35%。plan_011 ability\\\\n    cohort 在 θ 10/20-bin conditioning 下 TPR 从 76% 降到 21%（p=0.5）——原 5-bin 分层不足以消除 Q1-2\\\\n    vs Q4-5 极端能力差异。DIF 面临 TPR-FPR tradeoff：temporal 高 TPR 但 FPR=31%，ability (proper)\\\\n    低 FPR=8% 但 TPR=21%。根因：temporal cohort 间差异是多维的（不同学科能力提升不均匀），1D θ 无法捕获。Bifactor\\\\n    model (general + 57 subject factors) 是唯一能吸收学科级差异的结构性方法。已尝试 2 种不同类型改进方向，bifactor\\\\n    是第 3 种。计算量大（5227×12508×58 factors），可能需要服务器。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012_irt_theta_conditioning\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - temporal FPR stuck at 31%, ability TPR corrected to 21%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 22:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #2 分析：best=3/6, median=3-4/6, worst=3/6。跨档一致：impact-vs-DIF confound\\\\n    为首要问题，bifactor 是正确方向。新发现：ensemble 不优于 DIF alone、SIBTEST/MIMIC 未尝试、detection trilemma\\\\n    概念'\\\\n  rationale: 三档审稿一致认为 within-family confound (42-62% overlap) 是最致命问题——没有 bifactor\\\\n    分离学科级能力差异，DIF flags 的可解释性无法建立。worst case 新增 SIBTEST/MIMIC 作为 established impact-vs-DIF\\\\n    solutions 的替代方案需要考虑。median 指出 ensemble AUROC (0.72) 低于 DIF alone (0.76)，Claim\\\\n    2 需要重新评估。worst case 提出 detection trilemma (IRT fit ↔ power ↔ confound control)\\\\n    作为潜在概念贡献。行动：(1) 优先完成 bifactor，(2) 考虑 SIBTEST/MIMIC 作为备选，(3) 推迟 ensemble 设计到 bifactor\\\\n    结果出来后，(4) 补充 impact-vs-DIF 文献\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260520T205007\\\\n    role: dream_simulation\\\\n    result: best=3/6, median=3-4/6, worst=3/6\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 22:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 方向 3 (Bifactor) pre-check 否定：within-subject temporal C%=38.1% (range 31-45%)，高于\\\\n    overall 31%。Bifactor 移除的 between-subject variance 反而在压低 C%。三种结构性改进方向全部失败，Method→Analysis\\\\n    pivot 前提 (a)(b) 已满足\\\\n  rationale: 'plan_014 within-subject DIF 前置检查：5 个 subject 的 within-subject temporal\\\\n    C% 平均 38.1%，没有一个低于 30%。Cross-subject matching 仅 Δ=-2.4pp。这证明 temporal DIF 是 item-specific\\\\n    的真实差异（能力提升+污染+其他），不是 matching artifact。Bifactor 即使完美运行也无法降 FPR 到 15% 以下。决策链：D005(方向1失败)\\\\n    → D008(方向2失败) → D010(方向3 pre-mortem 证伪)。Oracle: plan_011 semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.508\\\\n    确认方法本身有效。Pivot 前提 (c) 待用户确认投稿目标调整。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014_within_subject_dif\\\\n    role: pre-check\\\\n    result: within-subject C%=38.1%, bifactor not viable\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: oracle\\\\n    result: ΔTPR=+0.508, method works for differential contamination\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 23:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pivot 拍板：从\\\\\\\"DIF 检测方法\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"LLM benchmark psychometric characterization + DIF\\\\n    methodology\\\\\\\"。Cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是方法论突破，31-38% temporal DIF 是实证发现。保持\\\\n    ICLR 2027 目标不降级\\\\n  rationale: 三种结构性改进全部穷尽（D005/D008/D010），oracle 确认方法有效（plan_011 ΔTPR=+0.508）。但 pivot\\\\n    不等于降级：(1) cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是干净的方法论贡献——解决了 matching variable contamination\\\\n    这个 MH-DIF 领域的实际问题；(2) 31-38% temporal DIF 是首次大规模量化 LLM benchmark item instability；(3)\\\\n    global vs differential contamination 区分是概念贡献；(4) semi-synthetic validation framework\\\\n    可独立复用；(5) detection trilemma 是 characterization 贡献。这些组合起来是 ICLR 级别的 empirical\\\\n    findings paper，不需要降到 findings track。用户批评\\\\\\\"等我点头\\\\\\\"正确——这是 PI 的决策责任。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_016_within_subject_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: final_validation\\\\n    result: cross-subject ΔFPR=0.000, 4/5 ΔTPR>0.3\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014_within_subject_dif\\\\n    role: pre-check\\\\n    result: within-subject C%=38.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: oracle\\\\n    result: ΔTPR=+0.508\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 23:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: Story 定稿：Candidate 1 (benchmark quality tool) + ground truth meta-critique\\\\n    + semi-synthetic infrastructure。降级 cross-subject matching 为 recommendation（非 breakthrough）。新增\\\\n    downstream impact 实验（移除 DIF items → ranking stability）作为 ICLR 关键补充\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估：(1) 三候选中 Candidate 1 最自洽，(2) cross-subject matching 是 external\\\\n    matching 的自然推广非新方法（降级），(3) enrichment≈1.0 + semi-synthetic positive 证明现有污染 ground\\\\n    truth 自身有缺陷（meta-contribution），(4) \\\\\\\"so what?\\\\\\\" 缺口是 ICLR vs findings track 的分水岭——需\\\\n    downstream impact 实验回答。38% 与 domain specificity ρ=0.307 的关系必须在 limitations 诚实讨论。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014_within_subject_dif\\\\n    role: finding\\\\n    result: 38% temporal DIF\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_016_within_subject_semi_synthetic\\\\n    role: method\\\\n    result: cross-subject ΔFPR=0.000\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n    role: finding\\\\n    result: enrichment≈1.0 → ground truth meta-critique\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 00:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_017 downstream impact negative 但 informative：DIF items 是浓缩差异化信号载体而非噪声。Claim\\\\n    4 从 placeholder \\\\\\\"remove for stability\\\\\\\" 转为 finding \\\\\\\"DIF as diagnostic lens\\\\\\\"。DIF\\\\n    items 移除造成更大排名扰动（21/21 条件显著），phi-3/llama-3 获益最多，mistral merge 被压制\\\\n  rationale: plan_017 全面证伪了\\\\\\\"移除 DIF items 改善排名稳定性\\\\\\\"的 hypothesis：(1) full vs stable-only\\\\n    ρ=0.996-0.999 说明排名本身极鲁棒，(2) DIF removal 扰动显著大于 random removal（z=-8 to -49σ），(3)\\\\n    DIF items 的跨代准确率变化是 full benchmark 的 1.09×。这意味着 DIF items 不是\\\\\\\"坏题\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"模型代际差异的诊断标记\\\\\\\"。对\\\\n    paper narrative 的影响：从\\\\\\\"remove unstable items\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"DIF as diagnostic lens for understanding\\\\n    model evolution\\\\\\\"。这个 negative result 比 positive 更有深度——\\\\\\\"keep these items, they tell\\\\n    you something\\\\\\\" 是更有价值的 benchmark design recommendation。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_017_downstream_impact\\\\n    role: hypothesis_test\\\\n    result: negative - DIF items carry MORE discriminative signal, not less\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 01:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_004 Step 3 GSM1K: |r|=0.478 显著但方向为负——DIF 不标记 contamination，而是标记 contamination\\\\n    无法到达的 capability-discriminative items'\\\\n  rationale: r=−0.478 (p=0.005), Spearman ρ=−0.403 (p=0.020), partial r=−0.385 (p=0.027\\\\n    控制 overall accuracy), permutation p=0.014, leave-one-out robust (min |r|=0.374)。N=33\\\\n    matched models。171 个 focal-favoring DIF-C items 驱动负相关 (r=−0.347, p=0.048)：contaminated\\\\n    models 在这些 genuine capability improvement items 上表现更差。这不支持 \\\\\\\"DIF = contamination\\\\n    detector\\\\\\\" 假设，但强力支撑 pivot 后 \\\\\\\"DIF as diagnostic lens\\\\\\\" 叙事：DIF 捕获的是真实能力差异，contamination\\\\n    产生的浅层提升无法到达这些 items。与 plan_017 (DIF items = discriminative signal carriers) 形成双重验证。不升级\\\\n    ICLR 为 \\\\\\\"validated method\\\\\\\"，但显著加强 characterization paper 的深度和跨 benchmark 证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_004_gsm8k_cross_benchmark\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: negative_but_informative\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_017_downstream_impact\\\\n    role: corroborating\\\\n    result: negative_but_informative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 03:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #3 post-pivot: best=3.5/6, median=3.5/6, worst=4/6 (anomalous ordering).\\\\n    10 confirmed action items identified across structural issues.'\\\\n  rationale: 三档一致的结构性问题（与数据好坏无关）：(1) ETS threshold 未校准——38% headline 锚定在未经验证的 cutoff\\\\n    上，(2) ρ=0.307 confound 无 decomposition，(3) related work 太薄，(4) 多重比较未处理，(5) 只测\\\\n    uniform DIF，(6) 论文过于发散。评分倒挂说明 framing/presentation 是瓶颈而非实验质量。确认行动项：A1 threshold\\\\n    sensitivity（P0，CPU），A8 instability decomposition（P0，CPU），A10 circularity ablation（P1），A9\\\\n    SIBTEST subset（P1），A3 BH correction（P1），A6 GSM1K CIs（P1）。写作行动项：A2 expanded related\\\\n    work，A4 scope pruning，A5 novelty articulation，A7 lead with 28.2%。忽略：venue downgrade\\\\n    建议、post-hoc narrative（单档）、\\\\\\\"FPR undermines utility\\\\\\\"（被 R2 反驳）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T012912\\\\n    role: dream simulation\\\\n    result: best=3.5/6, median=3.5/6, worst=4/6 (anomalous)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 04:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Re-dream #4 triggered after paper_framing.md structural rewrite: no-pivot\\\\n    narrative, scope pruning, 3-layer novelty, \\\\\\\"instability≠invalidity\\\\\\\" upfront'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #3 scored 3.5/6 due to writing/structure issues (scope bloat,\\\\n    late framing resolution, weak novelty articulation, pivot narrative impression),\\\\n    not experimental quality. All 7/10 supplementary analyses now complete with real\\\\n    data. paper_framing.md rewritten with: (1) no-pivot story spine starting from\\\\n    benchmark comparability, (2) explicit scope control (Bayesian DIF/RL/ensemble/pilots\\\\n    → appendix), (3) 3-layer novelty articulation (empirical discovery + meta-critique\\\\n    + framework), (4) \\\\\\\"instability ≠ invalidity\\\\\\\" framing upfront in intro. Literature\\\\n    expanded 15→45 papers. Re-dream to verify structural fixes improve score.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T012912\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: 3.5/6 best, 3.5/6 median, 4/6 worst — structural bottleneck\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T042647\\\\n    role: verification\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 05:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #4 结果: best=6/10, median=6/10, worst=5/10。结构修复有效，分数异常消除，但仍在 borderline'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #3→#4 变化: (1) best 从 borderline reject 升至 weak accept; (2) median\\\\n    从 borderline 升至 borderline accept; (3) worst 下降但正常（worst 应最低）; (4) 分数异常（worst>best）已消除，说明结构性问题已修复。三档一致指出的剩余问题:\\\\n    IRT misspecification (98% misfit), limited novelty (unmodified method), descriptive\\\\n    not mechanistic (缺 item characterization), model non-independence (fine-tunes\\\\n    inflate N), GSM1K underpowered (N=33)。可执行的改进: (a) item characterization by difficulty/format/domain,\\\\n    (b) model independence sensitivity (restrict to base models), (c) 更 cautious GSM1K\\\\n    framing。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T042647\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: best=6/10, median=6/10, worst=5/10\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T012912\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: best=3.5/6, median=3.5/6, worst=4/6\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 06:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_022/023 结果整合: model independence confirmed (C%≤random at all K),\\\\n    item characterization reveals difficulty×direction ρ=-0.597'\\\\n  rationale: plan_022 证明 family structure 不 inflate C%（回应 reviewer concern \\\\\\\"models\\\\n    not independent\\\\\\\"）。plan_023 发现 difficulty×direction ρ=-0.597 是最有价值的新发现——hardest\\\\n    items favor 2024, easiest favor 2023，系统性 pattern 强化 diagnostic lens narrative。两者已写入\\\\n    paper_framing.md v3，已派 Paper Agent 整合。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_022_model_independence\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: C% ≤ random subsample control at every cap K\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_023_item_characterization\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: difficulty×direction ρ=-0.597, domain χ² p=0.32\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 07:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Group C Final 审稿 4/10 Weak Reject。Action Matrix: 5个补分析(plan_024 within-family\\\\n    + ΔFPR CI + rank shifts + LD×DIF + Tutz核实) + 论文重组(Claim 4 + 叙事反转 + references)。拒绝\\\\n    venue 降级。'\\\\n  rationale: 两 Reviewer 共识 Contribution 2/4。核心问题：(1) 因果归因不足 (2) 61.3% within-family\\\\n    未利用 (3) cross-subject matching 有 1990s prior art。Reviewer 给出 4→6 路径：within-family\\\\n    分析 + model-specific rank shifts + case studies。全部 CPU 分析任务，无需 GPU。用户明确 ICLR 不降级，拒绝\\\\n    NeurIPS D&B 建议。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_024_within_family_deep_dive\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: dispatched to Agent\\\\n  - exp_id: group_c_final_review\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 4/10 weak reject\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 07:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #5 结果: best=borderline accept, median=4/10 WR, worst=2.5/5 LR。Median\\\\n    下降部分由 dream artifact 导致（FDR/refs 误判）。跨档一致: ability confound + novelty + ρ张力。plan_024\\\\n    matched C%=28.3% 直接回应最关键弱点。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #5 median 比 #4 低，但检查具体扣分点发现部分是 dream simulation artifact（BH FDR\\\\n    和 refs 数量被低估）。真正的结构性问题（因果归因、novelty、ρ张力）与 Group C 审稿报告一致。plan_024 的 ability-matched\\\\n    within-family C%=28.3% 是最有力的新数据。Best tier 指出 ConStat/Min-K% 直接对比是 \\\\\\\"most impactful\\\\n    missing experiment\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T062008\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: best=BA, median=4/10, worst=2.5/5\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_024_within_family_deep_dive\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: matched C%=28.3% addresses ability confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 08:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: Venue 从 ICLR 2027 切换到 EMNLP 2026 (ARR)。用户确认。8-page limit，当前 10 页需压缩。\\\\n  rationale: '用户确认目标会议为 EMNLP。EMNLP evaluation methodology dedicated area 更匹配 empirical\\\\n    contribution 类型。Group C 两位 Reviewer 和 Dream #5 均建议 EMNLP。Dream #5 best 在 ARR scale\\\\n    已达 3.5/5 (borderline accept)，推到 4 (conference) 可行。主要调整: 8-page limit 需压缩 2 页，叙事面向\\\\n    NLP 评测社区。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: group_c_final_review\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 4/10, venue change recommended\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T062008\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: best=3.5/5 on ARR scale\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 08:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_026 ConStat/DIF 对比完成: enrichment=0.964, Jaccard=0.206。Claim 2 从概念论证升级为实证论证。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #5 best-case reviewer 指出 ConStat 直接对比是 \\\\\\\"single most impactful\\\\n    missing experiment\\\\\\\"。结果强力支持 ground truth meta-critique: DIF 和 web-overlap 捕获根本不同信号\\\\n    (enrichment≈1.0, Jaccard=0.206, p=0.258 无显著关联)。已派 Paper Agent 整合进论文。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_026_constat_dif_comparison\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success — enrichment=0.964, Jaccard=0.206\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 08:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_027 temporal overlap: ability-matched C%=28.9%±0.1% (vs full 31.3%)。Ability\\\\n    confound 仅解释 2.4pp。31.3% 是 genuine item-level DIF。'\\\\n  rationale: '直接回应 RD2-W1 和 Dream #5 R1 Critical: temporal cohort ability gap 仅 d=-0.17\\\\n    (vs Llama d=-0.99)，1:1 NN matching (d≈-0.01) 后 C%=28.9%。与 Llama 的 61.3%→28.3%\\\\n    形成鲜明对比：Llama DIF 确实被 ability confound 膨胀，但 temporal cohort 的 31.3% 几乎不受影响。这是论文最有力的\\\\n    robustness 证据。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_027_temporal_overlap\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success — matched C%=28.9%, d=-0.17, overlap=76.4%\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_024_within_family_deep_dive\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: Llama matched C%=28.3%, d=-0.99, overlap=0.18\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 10:00 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #6 分析完成：Best=3.5 Median=3.0 Worst=2.5，识别 8 项结构性问题，派 Agent 3 项补充实验\\\\n    + Paper Agent 6 项修改'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream #6 三档一致暴露：(1) actionability gap（三档 Critical），(2) GSM1K over-featured（三档\\\\n    Major），(3) novelty=method transfer（三档 Major），(4) breadth>depth（三档），(5) causal\\\\n    ambiguity（三档），(6) IRT misfit（三档），(7) related work gaps（三档），(8) temporal coarseness（三档）。Worst\\\\n    独有的\\\\\\\"31%→2.9% framing misleading\\\\\\\"基于对 ability-quintile control 的误解（2.9%是 random-within-quintile\\\\n    control，不是 ability-matched temporal），忽略。确认行动：Agent 派 plan_028(多 benchmark DIF)、plan_029(permutation\\\\n    null)、plan_030(odds ratio+CI) 三项并行 CPU 任务；Paper Agent 派 P0-P5 六项修改（GSM1K降级、actionability\\\\n    protocol、strata clarification、novelty positioning、related work、IRT misfit defense）。目标：closing\\\\n    Best→4.0 的 0.5 分差距。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_028\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_029\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_030\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 10:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 plan_029 permutation null，集中资源推 plan_028 multi-benchmark\\\\n  rationale: plan_029 连续 4 次失败（Worker session 杀进程 + 纯 Python 循环太慢）。已有 random-split\\\\n    control (C%=0.18% vs observed 31.3%) 提供等效统计论证，permutation null 增量价值有限。plan_028\\\\n    multi-benchmark 直接回应\\\\\\\"only MMLU\\\\\\\"泛化性问题，优先级远高于 plan_029。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_029\\\\n    role: dropped\\\\n    result: 4 consecutive failures\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_028\\\\n    role: prioritized\\\\n    result: in progress\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_real_data_dif_mmlu\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: random-split C%=0.18% already provides null baseline\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 10:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_028 成功：6/6 benchmarks 确认 temporal DIF 泛化，Paper Agent 整合中\\\\n  rationale: '6 个 METABENCH benchmarks C% 范围 17.9-31.3%（random <1%），cross-benchmark\\\\n    generalizability 完全确认。知识类 (27-31%) vs 数学类 (18-19%) 的分化是额外 finding。Dream #6 所有后续任务完成（028\\\\n    ✅ 030 ✅ 029 放弃），派 Paper Agent 整合后 re-dream。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_028_multi_bench_dif\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'success: 6/6 benchmarks C%=17.9-31.3%'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_030_odds_ratio\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: 'success: Simpson''s paradox'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_029_permutation_null\\\\n    role: dropped\\\\n    result: abandoned D025\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 12:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream #7 分析：Best/Median=3.5, Worst=2.5。识别 4 项确认行动 + 3 项观察项，立即执行'\\\\n  rationale: '**三档一致问题（结构性）**：(1) 时间粒度粗糙 — 2023/2024 二分法 (2) 因果模糊性 — 语言需 hedge (3)\\\\n    半合成框架张力 — 需区分 detection vs interpretation (4) 审计协议欠发达 (5) actionability paradox\\\\n    (ρ=0.997)。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **Best 档 3.5→4.0 路径**（明确指出）：\\\\\\\"A reviewer could advocate for 4.0 if (a) detector\\\\n    comparison added, (b) code released, (c) causal language softened.\\\\\\\" 其中 (a) 我们已有\\\\n    plan_026 ConStat 数据，需确认论文中是否充分展示；(b)(c) 均为 Paper Agent 快修。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **确认行动项**：(A1) temporal granularity 实验 — CPU 几小时 (A2) 审计协议扩展 — Paper Agent (A3)\\\\n    code release 承诺 — Paper Agent 1 行 (A4) 因果语言 + 半合成 framing 修复 — Paper Agent (A5)\\\\n    \\\\\\\"DIF 对 LLM 意味着什么\\\\\\\" 段落 — Paper Agent (A6) 确认 plan_026 detector comparison 在论文中足够显眼\\\\n    (A7) Bootstrap CI on C%\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **观察项**：IRT misfit（P5 已辩护）、GSM1K underpowered（已降级 exploratory）、limited novelty（inherent）'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260521T110541\\\\n    role: evaluation\\\\n    result: Best=3.5 Median=3.5 Worst=2.5\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 13:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_032/033 完成：DIF-cleaned MMLU 展示 89.5% 模型排名变 ≥5 位 + subject DIF 浓度均匀但有\\\\n    5 个 excess subjects\\\\n  rationale: plan_032 化解 actionability paradox：ρ=0.997 掩盖了 89.5% 模型排名变 ≥5 位、24.8%\\\\n    变 ≥100 位的局部扰动，且系统性偏向