r full\\\\n      calibration; core methodology for our bifactor IRT equating with anchor items\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: ''\\\\n    title: Application of IRT Fixed Parameter Calibration to Multiple-Group Test Data\\\\n    url: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/08957347.2019.1660344\\\\n    venue: Applied Measurement in Education\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    year: 2019\\\\n  li2024contamination:\\\\n    abstract: ''\\\\n    added_at: '2026-05-21T01:40:37.987Z'\\\\n    added_by: literature-gap-fill\\\\n    authors:\\\\n    - Li, Y.\\\\n    - Guo, Y.\\\\n    - Guerin, F.\\\\n    - Lin, C.\\\\n    bibtex_key: li2024contamination\\\\n    category: contamination_detection\\\\n    doi: 10.18653/v1/2024.findings-emnlp.30\\\\n    relevance: Provides web-overlap contamination labels for MMLU and other benchmarks\\\\n      via Common Crawl matching; primary ground-truth comparison for our DIF-based\\\\n      contamination detection\\\\n    role: foundation\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: 32e11cf020021c225782a3b77b5cfed4ae8e14a0\\\\n    title: An Open-Source Data Contamination Report for Large Language Models\\\\n    url: https://aclanthology.org/2024.findings-emnlp.30/\\\\n    venue: Findings of EMNLP 2024\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n  liang2026dvd:\\\\n    abstract: ''\\\\n    added_at: '2026-05-20T17:30:00.000Z'\\\\n    added_by: director\\\\n    authors:\\\\n    - Liang, R.\\\\n    bibtex_key: liang2026dvd\\\\n    category: contamination_detection\\\\n    doi: ''\\\\n    relevance: Detects variant contamination via generation variance (AUC 0.73-0.74\\\\n      vs Min-K++ 0.43-0.68); complementary signal in our ensemble but untested under\\\\n      RL training\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: ''\\\\n    title: 'DVD: Detection via Variance of Generation Distribution for Variant Contamination'\\\\n    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.04895\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    